
/* ===== RACINE N-IÈME — PC / SM / SVT (content from Racine_d_ordre_n_AI_ready_1.md FR / Nth_root_course_EN.md / Nth_root_course_AR.md; same engine as Continuité) ===== */
const RNLES=[{"id":"rn-l1","title":["Introduction et définition","Introduction and definition","تمهيد والتعريف"],"steps":[{"id":"s1","t":["1. Introduction","1. Introduction","1. تمهيد"],"story":{"fr":"","en":""},"blocks":[{"fr":"On connaît $x \\mapsto x^2$ et sa réciproque $x \\mapsto \\sqrt{x}$. Pour chaque entier $n \\ge 1$, la fonction $x \\mapsto x^n$ a aussi une réciproque, la **racine $n$-ième** $\\sqrt[n]{x}$ :","en":"We know $x \\mapsto x^2$ and its inverse $x \\mapsto \\sqrt{x}$. For every integer $n \\ge 1$, the function $x \\mapsto x^n$ also has an inverse, the **$n$-th root** $\\sqrt[n]{x}$:"},{"fr":"• réciproque de $x^3$ : la racine cubique $\\sqrt[3]{x}$ ;","en":"• inverse of $x^3$: the cube root $\\sqrt[3]{x}$;"},{"fr":"• réciproque de $x^4$ : la racine quatrième $\\sqrt[4]{x}$ ;","en":"• inverse of $x^4$: the fourth root $\\sqrt[4]{x}$;"},{"fr":"• réciproque de $x^{1000}$ : la racine $1000$-ième $\\sqrt[1000]{x}$.","en":"• inverse of $x^{1000}$: the $1000$-th root $\\sqrt[1000]{x}$."}],"apps":[]},{"id":"s2","t":["2. Définition","2. Definition","2. التعريف"],"story":{"fr":"","en":""},"blocks":[{"fr":"Soit $n \\in \\mathbb{N}^*$. La fonction $f : x \\mapsto x^n$ définie sur $I = [0, +\\infty[$ admet une fonction réciproque $f^{-1}$ définie sur $J = f(I) = [0, +\\infty[$. Elle s’appelle la **fonction racine d’ordre $n$**, notée $\\sqrt[n]{\\ }$ :","en":"Let $n \\in \\mathbb{N}^*$. The function $f : x \\mapsto x^n$ defined on $I = [0, +\\infty[$ has an inverse function $f^{-1}$ defined on $J = f(I) = [0, +\\infty[$. It is called the **$n$-th root function**, denoted $\\sqrt[n]{\\ }$:"},{"fr":"$\\displaystyle \\forall x \\ge 0,\\ \\forall y \\ge 0 : \\quad x^n = y \\iff x = \\sqrt[n]{y}$","en":"$\\displaystyle \\forall x \\ge 0,\\ \\forall y \\ge 0 : \\quad x^n = y \\iff x = \\sqrt[n]{y}$"},{"fr":"**Remarque : racines d’indice impair.** Si $n$ est **impair**, $x \\mapsto x^n$ est bijective de $\\mathbb{R}$ dans $\\mathbb{R}$. La racine $\\sqrt[n]{x}$ est alors définie pour **tout** réel et $\\sqrt[n]{-x} = -\\sqrt[n]{x}$ (exemple : $\\sqrt[3]{-8} = -2$). Si $n$ est **pair**, $\\sqrt[n]{x}$ n’existe que pour $x \\ge 0$. Cette remarque est utilisée dans tout le cours (équations, limites en $-\\infty$).","en":"**Remark: roots of odd index.** If $n$ is **odd**, $x \\mapsto x^n$ is a bijection from $\\mathbb{R}$ to $\\mathbb{R}$. The root $\\sqrt[n]{x}$ is then defined for **every** real number and $\\sqrt[n]{-x} = -\\sqrt[n]{x}$ (example: $\\sqrt[3]{-8} = -2$). If $n$ is **even**, $\\sqrt[n]{x}$ exists only for $x \\ge 0$. This remark is used throughout the course (equations, limits at $-\\infty$)."}],"apps":[]}]},{"id":"rn-l2","title":["Propriétés","Properties","الخاصيات"],"steps":[{"id":"s1","t":["3. Propriétés","3. Properties","3. الخاصيات"],"story":{"fr":"","en":""},"blocks":[{"fr":"Pour $x \\ge 0$, $y > 0$ et $n, p, q \\in \\mathbb{N}^*$ :","en":"For $x \\ge 0$, $y > 0$ and $n, p, q \\in \\mathbb{N}^*$:"},{"dtab":{"fr":[["Propriété","Propriété"],["$\\left(\\sqrt[n]{x}\\right)^n = x$","$\\sqrt[n]{x^n} = x$"],["$\\sqrt[n]{xy} = \\sqrt[n]{x}\\,\\sqrt[n]{y}$","$\\sqrt[n]{\\dfrac{x}{y}} = \\dfrac{\\sqrt[n]{x}}{\\sqrt[n]{y}}$"],["$\\left(\\sqrt[n]{x}\\right)^p = \\sqrt[n]{x^p}$","$\\sqrt[np]{x^p} = \\sqrt[n]{x}$"],["$\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[p]{x}} = \\sqrt[np]{x}$","$\\sqrt[q]{x^p} = x^{p/q}$"]],"en":[["Property","Property"],["$\\left(\\sqrt[n]{x}\\right)^n = x$","$\\sqrt[n]{x^n} = x$"],["$\\sqrt[n]{xy} = \\sqrt[n]{x}\\,\\sqrt[n]{y}$","$\\sqrt[n]{\\dfrac{x}{y}} = \\dfrac{\\sqrt[n]{x}}{\\sqrt[n]{y}}$"],["$\\left(\\sqrt[n]{x}\\right)^p = \\sqrt[n]{x^p}$","$\\sqrt[np]{x^p} = \\sqrt[n]{x}$"],["$\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[p]{x}} = \\sqrt[np]{x}$","$\\sqrt[q]{x^p} = x^{p/q}$"]],"ar":[["الخاصية","الخاصية"],["$\\left(\\sqrt[n]{x}\\right)^n = x$","$\\sqrt[n]{x^n} = x$"],["$\\sqrt[n]{xy} = \\sqrt[n]{x}\\,\\sqrt[n]{y}$","$\\sqrt[n]{\\dfrac{x}{y}} = \\dfrac{\\sqrt[n]{x}}{\\sqrt[n]{y}}$"],["$\\left(\\sqrt[n]{x}\\right)^p = \\sqrt[n]{x^p}$","$\\sqrt[np]{x^p} = \\sqrt[n]{x}$"],["$\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[p]{x}} = \\sqrt[np]{x}$","$\\sqrt[q]{x^p} = x^{p/q}$"]]}},{"fr":"**Puissances rationnelles.** Pour $a > 0$, $b > 0$ et $r, r' \\in \\mathbb{Q}$ :","en":"**Rational powers.** For $a > 0$, $b > 0$ and $r, r' \\in \\mathbb{Q}$:"},{"fr":"• $a^r \\times a^{r'} = a^{r+r'}$ et $\\dfrac{a^r}{a^{r'}} = a^{r-r'}$","en":"• $a^r \\times a^{r'} = a^{r+r'}$ and $\\dfrac{a^r}{a^{r'}} = a^{r-r'}$"},{"fr":"• $(a^r)^{r'} = a^{rr'}$","en":"• $(a^r)^{r'} = a^{rr'}$"},{"fr":"• $(ab)^r = a^r b^r$ et $\\left(\\dfrac{a}{b}\\right)^r = \\dfrac{a^r}{b^r}$","en":"• $(ab)^r = a^r b^r$ and $\\left(\\dfrac{a}{b}\\right)^r = \\dfrac{a^r}{b^r}$"},{"fr":"• $a^{-r} = \\dfrac{1}{a^r}$","en":"• $a^{-r} = \\dfrac{1}{a^r}$"},{"fr":"• si $r = \\dfrac{p}{q}$ avec $p \\in \\mathbb{Z}$, $q \\in \\mathbb{N}^*$ : $a^{p/q} = \\sqrt[q]{a^p}$","en":"• if $r = \\dfrac{p}{q}$ with $p \\in \\mathbb{Z}$, $q \\in \\mathbb{N}^*$: $a^{p/q} = \\sqrt[q]{a^p}$"}],"apps":[]}]},{"id":"rn-l3","title":["Simplification des racines $n$-ièmes","Simplifying $n$-th roots","تبسيط الجذور من الرتبة $n$"],"steps":[{"id":"s1","t":["4. Simplification des racines $n$-ièmes","4. Simplifying $n$-th roots","4. تبسيط الجذور من الرتبة $n$"],"story":{"fr":"","en":""},"blocks":[{"fr":"**Idée clé :** transformer chaque racine en puissance, $\\sqrt[n]{a^m} = a^{m/n}$, puis utiliser les règles des puissances.","en":"**Key idea:** turn each root into a power, $\\sqrt[n]{a^m} = a^{m/n}$, then use the rules for powers."},{"fr":"Pour $a, b \\ge 0$ : $\\sqrt[n]{a}\\,\\sqrt[n]{b} = \\sqrt[n]{ab}$ et $\\dfrac{\\sqrt[n]{a}}{\\sqrt[n]{b}} = \\sqrt[n]{\\dfrac{a}{b}}$ (**même indice obligatoire**), $\\left(\\sqrt[n]{a}\\right)^n = a$, $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[m]{a}} = \\sqrt[nm]{a}$.","en":"For $a, b \\ge 0$: $\\sqrt[n]{a}\\,\\sqrt[n]{b} = \\sqrt[n]{ab}$ and $\\dfrac{\\sqrt[n]{a}}{\\sqrt[n]{b}} = \\sqrt[n]{\\dfrac{a}{b}}$ (**the index must be the same**), $\\left(\\sqrt[n]{a}\\right)^n = a$, $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[m]{a}} = \\sqrt[nm]{a}$."},{"fr":"**Trois étapes :**","en":"**Three steps:**"},{"fr":"1. **Décomposer** le nombre sous la racine : $625 = 5^4$, $1024 = 2^{10}$, $16 = 2^4$.","en":"1. **Decompose** the number under the root: $625 = 5^4$, $1024 = 2^{10}$, $16 = 2^4$."},{"fr":"2. **Simplifier** quand l’exposant est égal à l’indice : $\\sqrt[4]{5^4} = 5$.","en":"2. **Simplify** when the exponent equals the index: $\\sqrt[4]{5^4} = 5$."},{"fr":"3. **Réduire au même indice** (multiple commun) pour comparer ou multiplier des racines d’indices différents.","en":"3. **Reduce to the same index** (common multiple) to compare or multiply roots with different indices."}],"apps":[]},{"id":"s2","t":["Application 1 : simplifier","Application 1: simplify","تطبيق 1: التبسيط"],"story":{"fr":"","en":""},"blocks":[{"fr":"**Énoncé :** $A = \\sqrt[3]{54} + \\sqrt[3]{16} - \\sqrt[3]{128}$ ; $B = \\sqrt[4]{81} \\times \\sqrt[3]{8} - \\sqrt[5]{32}$ ; $C = \\sqrt[3]{2} \\times \\sqrt[6]{4}$ ; $D = \\dfrac{\\sqrt[4]{3^6} \\times \\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt[6]{3^9}}$.","en":"**Statement:** $A = \\sqrt[3]{54} + \\sqrt[3]{16} - \\sqrt[3]{128}$; $B = \\sqrt[4]{81} \\times \\sqrt[3]{8} - \\sqrt[5]{32}$; $C = \\sqrt[3]{2} \\times \\sqrt[6]{4}$; $D = \\dfrac{\\sqrt[4]{3^6} \\times \\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt[6]{3^9}}$."},{"fr":"**Correction :**","en":"**Solution:**"},{"fr":"• **A.** $\\sqrt[3]{54} = 3\\sqrt[3]{2}$, $\\sqrt[3]{16} = 2\\sqrt[3]{2}$, $\\sqrt[3]{128} = 4\\sqrt[3]{2}$, donc $A = (3 + 2 - 4)\\sqrt[3]{2} = \\sqrt[3]{2}$.","en":"• **A.** $\\sqrt[3]{54} = 3\\sqrt[3]{2}$, $\\sqrt[3]{16} = 2\\sqrt[3]{2}$, $\\sqrt[3]{128} = 4\\sqrt[3]{2}$, so $A = (3 + 2 - 4)\\sqrt[3]{2} = \\sqrt[3]{2}$."},{"fr":"• **B.** $\\sqrt[4]{81} = 3$, $\\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$, $\\sqrt[5]{32} = 2$, donc $B = 3 \\times 2 - 2 = 4$.","en":"• **B.** $\\sqrt[4]{81} = 3$, $\\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$, $\\sqrt[5]{32} = 2$, so $B = 3 \\times 2 - 2 = 4$."},{"fr":"• **C.** $\\sqrt[6]{4} = 2^{2/6} = 2^{1/3}$, donc $C = 2^{1/3} \\times 2^{1/3} = 2^{2/3} = \\sqrt[3]{4}$.","en":"• **C.** $\\sqrt[6]{4} = 2^{2/6} = 2^{1/3}$, so $C = 2^{1/3} \\times 2^{1/3} = 2^{2/3} = \\sqrt[3]{4}$."},{"fr":"• **D.** $3^{6/4} = 3^{3/2}$, $\\sqrt{3} = 3^{1/2}$, $3^{9/6} = 3^{3/2}$, donc $D = \\dfrac{3^{3/2} \\times 3^{1/2}}{3^{3/2}} = 3^{1/2} = \\sqrt{3}$.","en":"• **D.** $3^{6/4} = 3^{3/2}$, $\\sqrt{3} = 3^{1/2}$, $3^{9/6} = 3^{3/2}$, so $D = \\dfrac{3^{3/2} \\times 3^{1/2}}{3^{3/2}} = 3^{1/2} = \\sqrt{3}$."}],"apps":[]},{"id":"s3","t":["Application 2 : ranger par ordre croissant","Application 2: order from smallest to largest","تطبيق 2: الترتيب تصاعديًا"],"story":{"fr":"","en":""},"blocks":[{"fr":"**Énoncé :** a) $\\sqrt[3]{3}$, $\\sqrt{2}$, $\\sqrt[6]{10}$ ; b) $\\sqrt[3]{2}$, $\\sqrt[4]{5}$, $\\sqrt{3}$.","en":"**Statement:** a) $\\sqrt[3]{3}$, $\\sqrt{2}$, $\\sqrt[6]{10}$; b) $\\sqrt[3]{2}$, $\\sqrt[4]{5}$, $\\sqrt{3}$."},{"fr":"**Correction :**","en":"**Solution:**"},{"fr":"• **a)** Indice $6$ : $\\sqrt[3]{3} = \\sqrt[6]{9}$, $\\sqrt{2} = \\sqrt[6]{8}$, $\\sqrt[6]{10}$. Comme $8 < 9 < 10$ : $\\sqrt{2} < \\sqrt[3]{3} < \\sqrt[6]{10}$.","en":"• **a)** Index $6$: $\\sqrt[3]{3} = \\sqrt[6]{9}$, $\\sqrt{2} = \\sqrt[6]{8}$, $\\sqrt[6]{10}$. Since $8 < 9 < 10$: $\\sqrt{2} < \\sqrt[3]{3} < \\sqrt[6]{10}$."},{"fr":"• **b)** Indice $12$ : $\\sqrt[3]{2} = \\sqrt[12]{2^4} = \\sqrt[12]{16}$, $\\sqrt[4]{5} = \\sqrt[12]{5^3} = \\sqrt[12]{125}$, $\\sqrt{3} = \\sqrt[12]{3^6} = \\sqrt[12]{729}$. Comme $16 < 125 < 729$ : $\\sqrt[3]{2} < \\sqrt[4]{5} < \\sqrt{3}$.","en":"• **b)** Index $12$: $\\sqrt[3]{2} = \\sqrt[12]{2^4} = \\sqrt[12]{16}$, $\\sqrt[4]{5} = \\sqrt[12]{5^3} = \\sqrt[12]{125}$, $\\sqrt{3} = \\sqrt[12]{3^6} = \\sqrt[12]{729}$. Since $16 < 125 < 729$: $\\sqrt[3]{2} < \\sqrt[4]{5} < \\sqrt{3}$."}],"apps":[]}]},{"id":"rn-l4","title":["Identités remarquables et équations","Remarkable identities and equations","المتطابقات الهامة والمعادلات"],"steps":[{"id":"s1","t":["5.1 Identités","5.1 Identities","5.1 المتطابقات"],"story":{"fr":"","en":""},"blocks":[{"fr":"$\\displaystyle a^3 + b^3 = (a+b)(a^2 - ab + b^2) \\qquad a^3 - b^3 = (a-b)(a^2 + ab + b^2)$","en":"$\\displaystyle a^3 + b^3 = (a+b)(a^2 - ab + b^2) \\qquad a^3 - b^3 = (a-b)(a^2 + ab + b^2)$"},{"fr":"Le second facteur $a^2 \\pm ab + b^2$ ne s’annule que si $a = b = 0$ (pour $b \\neq 0$ fixé, son discriminant est $-3b^2 < 0$). Dans les équations, **seul le premier facteur** donne des solutions réelles.","en":"The second factor $a^2 \\pm ab + b^2$ vanishes only if $a = b = 0$ (for fixed $b \\neq 0$, its discriminant is $-3b^2 < 0$). In equations, **only the first factor** gives real solutions."}],"apps":[]},{"id":"s2","t":["5.2 Résoudre une équation avec des racines","5.2 Solving an equation with roots","5.2 حل معادلة تحتوي على جذور"],"story":{"fr":"","en":""},"blocks":[{"fr":"**Méthode en 5 étapes :**","en":"**Method in 5 steps:**"},{"fr":"1. **Condition d’existence.** Indice pair (racine carrée) : le contenu doit être $\\ge 0$. Indice impair (racine cubique) : aucune condition.","en":"1. **Existence condition.** Even index (square root): the radicand must be $\\ge 0$. Odd index (cube root): no condition."},{"fr":"2. **Isoler** la racine d’un côté du signe $=$.","en":"2. **Isolate** the root on one side of the $=$ sign."},{"fr":"3. **Élever à la puissance $n$** des deux côtés ($n$ = indice) : $\\left(\\sqrt[n]{A}\\right)^n = A$.","en":"3. **Raise to the power $n$** on both sides ($n$ = index): $\\left(\\sqrt[n]{A}\\right)^n = A$."},{"fr":"4. **Résoudre** l’équation obtenue (factorisation, identités, discriminant $\\Delta$).","en":"4. **Solve** the resulting equation (factorisation, identities, discriminant $\\Delta$)."},{"fr":"5. **Vérifier chaque solution.** Obligatoire pour les indices pairs : l’élévation au carré peut créer de fausses solutions.","en":"5. **Check every solution.** Mandatory for even indices: squaring can create false solutions."},{"fr":"**Cas $x^n = a$ :**","en":"**Case $x^n = a$:**"},{"fr":"• $n$ impair : une seule solution, $x = \\sqrt[n]{a}$ (quel que soit le signe de $a$).","en":"• $n$ odd: a single solution, $x = \\sqrt[n]{a}$ (whatever the sign of $a$)."},{"fr":"• $n$ pair et $a > 0$ : deux solutions, $x = \\pm\\sqrt[n]{a}$.","en":"• $n$ even and $a > 0$: two solutions, $x = \\pm\\sqrt[n]{a}$."},{"fr":"• $n$ pair et $a < 0$ : aucune solution.","en":"• $n$ even and $a < 0$: no solution."},{"fr":"**Cas $x^3 \\pm a^3 = 0$ :** on utilise les identités, puis on vérifie que le second facteur a $\\Delta < 0$.","en":"**Case $x^3 \\pm a^3 = 0$:** use the identities, then check that the second factor has $\\Delta < 0$."}],"apps":[]},{"id":"s3","t":["Application : résoudre dans $\\mathbb{R}$","Application: solve in $\\mathbb{R}$","تطبيق: حل في $\\mathbb{R}$"],"story":{"fr":"","en":""},"blocks":[{"fr":"**Énoncé :** $E_1 : x^3 - 64 = 0$ ; $E_2 : x^3 + 125 = 0$ ; $E_3 : \\sqrt[3]{x^2 - x + 2} = 2$ ; $E_4 : \\sqrt{2x+3} = x$ ; $E_5 : x^4 - 16 = 0$.","en":"**Statement:** $E_1 : x^3 - 64 = 0$; $E_2 : x^3 + 125 = 0$; $E_3 : \\sqrt[3]{x^2 - x + 2} = 2$; $E_4 : \\sqrt{2x+3} = x$; $E_5 : x^4 - 16 = 0$."},{"fr":"**Correction :**","en":"**Solution:**"},{"fr":"• $E_1$ : $x^3 - 4^3 = (x-4)(x^2 + 4x + 16) = 0$. Pour le 2e facteur, $\\Delta = 16 - 64 < 0$. $S = \\{4\\}$.","en":"• $E_1$: $x^3 - 4^3 = (x-4)(x^2 + 4x + 16) = 0$. For the 2nd factor, $\\Delta = 16 - 64 < 0$. $S = \\{4\\}$."},{"fr":"• $E_2$ : $x^3 + 5^3 = (x+5)(x^2 - 5x + 25) = 0$. Pour le 2e facteur, $\\Delta = 25 - 100 < 0$. $S = \\{-5\\}$.","en":"• $E_2$: $x^3 + 5^3 = (x+5)(x^2 - 5x + 25) = 0$. For the 2nd factor, $\\Delta = 25 - 100 < 0$. $S = \\{-5\\}$."},{"fr":"• $E_3$ : aucune condition (indice $3$). On élève au cube : $x^2 - x + 2 = 8$, donc $x^2 - x - 6 = 0$, $\\Delta = 25$, $x = \\dfrac{1 \\pm 5}{2}$, soit $x = 3$ ou $x = -2$. Vérification : $9 - 3 + 2 = 8$ ✓ et $4 + 2 + 2 = 8$ ✓. $S = \\{-2, 3\\}$.","en":"• $E_3$: no condition (index $3$). Cube both sides: $x^2 - x + 2 = 8$, so $x^2 - x - 6 = 0$, $\\Delta = 25$, $x = \\dfrac{1 \\pm 5}{2}$, i.e. $x = 3$ or $x = -2$. Check: $9 - 3 + 2 = 8$ ✓ and $4 + 2 + 2 = 8$ ✓. $S = \\{-2, 3\\}$."},{"fr":"• $E_4$ : conditions $2x + 3 \\ge 0$ et $x \\ge 0$ (une racine carrée est positive). On élève au carré : $2x + 3 = x^2$, donc $(x-3)(x+1) = 0$. $x = 3$ convient ($\\sqrt{9} = 3$ ✓). $x = -1$ est rejeté ($x \\ge 0$ non respecté : $\\sqrt{1} = 1 \\neq -1$). $S = \\{3\\}$.","en":"• $E_4$: conditions $2x + 3 \\ge 0$ and $x \\ge 0$ (a square root is non-negative). Square both sides: $2x + 3 = x^2$, so $(x-3)(x+1) = 0$. $x = 3$ works ($\\sqrt{9} = 3$ ✓). $x = -1$ is rejected ($x \\ge 0$ fails: $\\sqrt{1} = 1 \\neq -1$). $S = \\{3\\}$."},{"fr":"• $E_5$ : $x^4 = 16$ avec $n = 4$ pair et $16 > 0$, donc $x = \\pm\\sqrt[4]{16} = \\pm 2$. $S = \\{-2, 2\\}$.","en":"• $E_5$: $x^4 = 16$ with $n = 4$ even and $16 > 0$, so $x = \\pm\\sqrt[4]{16} = \\pm 2$. $S = \\{-2, 2\\}$."}],"apps":[]}]},{"id":"rn-l5","title":["Limites avec racines","Limits with roots","النهايات والجذور"],"steps":[{"id":"s1","t":["6. Limites avec racines","6. Limits with roots","6. النهايات والجذور"],"story":{"fr":"","en":""},"blocks":[{"fr":"**À retenir.** Pour une limite avec une racine carrée, on remplace $x$ d’abord. Si on obtient une forme indéterminée ($\\frac{0}{0}$ ou $\\infty - \\infty$), on multiplie par la **quantité conjuguée**. Pour une racine cubique, le conjugué n’est plus $(a+b)$ : on utilise $a^3 - b^3 = (a-b)(a^2 + ab + b^2)$.","en":"**Remember.** For a limit with a square root, first substitute $x$. If you get an indeterminate form ($\\frac{0}{0}$ or $\\infty - \\infty$), multiply by the **conjugate**. For a cube root, the conjugate is no longer $(a+b)$: use $a^3 - b^3 = (a-b)(a^2 + ab + b^2)$."},{"fr":"Pour une expression $\\sqrt[3]{A} - b$ : on pose $a = \\sqrt[3]{A}$, on multiplie en haut et en bas par $a^2 + ab + b^2$ (**conjugué cubique**), et le numérateur devient $a^3 - b^3 = A - b^3$, sans aucune racine.","en":"For an expression $\\sqrt[3]{A} - b$: set $a = \\sqrt[3]{A}$, multiply top and bottom by $a^2 + ab + b^2$ (the **cubic conjugate**), and the numerator becomes $a^3 - b^3 = A - b^3$, with no root left."},{"dtab":{"fr":[["Racine carrée","Racine cubique"],["$(\\sqrt{A} - b)(\\sqrt{A} + b) = A - b^2$","$\\left(\\sqrt[3]{A} - b\\right)\\left(\\sqrt[3]{A^2} + b\\sqrt[3]{A} + b^2\\right) = A - b^3$"]],"en":[["Square root","Cube root"],["$(\\sqrt{A} - b)(\\sqrt{A} + b) = A - b^2$","$\\left(\\sqrt[3]{A} - b\\right)\\left(\\sqrt[3]{A^2} + b\\sqrt[3]{A} + b^2\\right) = A - b^3$"]],"ar":[["الجذر المربع","الجذر التكعيبي"],["$(\\sqrt{A} - b)(\\sqrt{A} + b) = A - b^2$","$\\left(\\sqrt[3]{A} - b\\right)\\left(\\sqrt[3]{A^2} + b\\sqrt[3]{A} + b^2\\right) = A - b^3$"]]}},{"fr":"**Étapes :**","en":"**Steps:**"},{"fr":"1. Remplacer $x$ par la valeur. Si forme indéterminée, passer à l’étape 2.","en":"1. Substitute the value of $x$. If the form is indeterminate, go to step 2."},{"fr":"2. Multiplier par le conjugué (carré ou cubique).","en":"2. Multiply by the conjugate (square or cubic)."},{"fr":"3. Simplifier : le facteur qui annule le dénominateur disparaît.","en":"3. Simplify: the factor that cancels the denominator disappears."},{"fr":"4. Remplacer à nouveau.","en":"4. Substitute again."},{"fr":"**En $\\pm\\infty$**, on peut aussi factoriser le terme dominant. Attention : $\\sqrt[4]{x^4} = |x|$ (indice pair), alors que $\\sqrt[3]{x^3} = x$ (indice impair).","en":"**At $\\pm\\infty$**, you can also factor out the dominant term. Careful: $\\sqrt[4]{x^4} = |x|$ (even index), whereas $\\sqrt[3]{x^3} = x$ (odd index)."},{"fr":"**Exemple :** $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+1} - 1}{x}$. En $0$ : $\\frac{0}{0}$. On pose $a = \\sqrt[3]{x+1}$, $b = 1$, et on multiplie par $a^2 + a + 1$ :","en":"**Example:** $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+1} - 1}{x}$. At $0$: $\\frac{0}{0}$. Set $a = \\sqrt[3]{x+1}$, $b = 1$, and multiply by $a^2 + a + 1$:"},{"fr":"$\\displaystyle \\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+1} - 1}{x} = \\frac{(x+1) - 1}{x\\left(\\sqrt[3]{(x+1)^2} + \\sqrt[3]{x+1} + 1\\right)} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{(x+1)^2} + \\sqrt[3]{x+1} + 1} \\xrightarrow[x \\to 0]{} \\frac{1}{3}$","en":"$\\displaystyle \\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+1} - 1}{x} = \\frac{(x+1) - 1}{x\\left(\\sqrt[3]{(x+1)^2} + \\sqrt[3]{x+1} + 1\\right)} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{(x+1)^2} + \\sqrt[3]{x+1} + 1} \\xrightarrow[x \\to 0]{} \\frac{1}{3}$"},{"fr":"**Hors programme mais bon à savoir : dériver une racine $n$-ième.** On écrit $\\sqrt[n]{u} = u^{1/n}$ et on dérive comme une puissance : $(u^\\alpha)' = \\alpha\\, u^{\\alpha - 1}\\, u'$. Exemple : $g(x) = \\sqrt[3]{x^2 + 1} = (x^2+1)^{1/3}$, donc $g'(x) = \\dfrac{1}{3}(x^2+1)^{-2/3} \\cdot 2x = \\dfrac{2x}{3\\sqrt[3]{(x^2+1)^2}}$.","en":"**Beyond the syllabus but good to know: differentiating an $n$-th root.** Write $\\sqrt[n]{u} = u^{1/n}$ and differentiate like a power: $(u^\\alpha)' = \\alpha\\, u^{\\alpha - 1}\\, u'$. Example: $g(x) = \\sqrt[3]{x^2 + 1} = (x^2+1)^{1/3}$, so $g'(x) = \\dfrac{1}{3}(x^2+1)^{-2/3} \\cdot 2x = \\dfrac{2x}{3\\sqrt[3]{(x^2+1)^2}}$."}],"apps":[]},{"id":"s2","t":["Applications","Applications","تطبيقات"],"story":{"fr":"","en":""},"blocks":[{"fr":"**Énoncé :**","en":"**Statement:**"},{"fr":"1. $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{\\sqrt[3]{9x-1} - 2}{x - 1}$","en":"1. $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{\\sqrt[3]{9x-1} - 2}{x - 1}$"},{"fr":"2. $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to +\\infty} \\left(\\sqrt[3]{x^3 + 5x^2 + 1} - x\\right)$","en":"2. $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to +\\infty} \\left(\\sqrt[3]{x^3 + 5x^2 + 1} - x\\right)$"},{"fr":"3. $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to -\\infty} \\frac{\\sqrt[4]{x^4 + 1} - 2}{x + 5}$","en":"3. $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to -\\infty} \\frac{\\sqrt[4]{x^4 + 1} - 2}{x + 5}$"},{"fr":"**Correction :**","en":"**Solution:**"},{"fr":"1. En $x = 1$ : $\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{8} - 2}{0} = \\frac{0}{0}$. On pose $a = \\sqrt[3]{9x-1}$, $b = 2$, conjugué $a^2 + 2a + 4$ : $\\dfrac{(9x-1) - 8}{(x-1)(a^2 + 2a + 4)} = \\dfrac{9}{a^2 + 2a + 4} \\to \\dfrac{9}{12} = \\dfrac{3}{4}$.","en":"1. At $x = 1$: $\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{8} - 2}{0} = \\frac{0}{0}$. Set $a = \\sqrt[3]{9x-1}$, $b = 2$, conjugate $a^2 + 2a + 4$: $\\dfrac{(9x-1) - 8}{(x-1)(a^2 + 2a + 4)} = \\dfrac{9}{a^2 + 2a + 4} \\to \\dfrac{9}{12} = \\dfrac{3}{4}$."},{"fr":"2. Forme $\\infty - \\infty$. On pose $a = \\sqrt[3]{x^3 + 5x^2 + 1}$, $b = x$ : $\\dfrac{a^3 - x^3}{a^2 + ax + x^2} = \\dfrac{5x^2 + 1}{a^2 + ax + x^2}$. Avec $u = 1 + \\frac{5}{x} + \\frac{1}{x^3}$, $a = x\\,u^{1/3}$, et on divise par $x^2$ : $\\dfrac{5 + \\frac{1}{x^2}}{u^{2/3} + u^{1/3} + 1} \\to \\dfrac{5}{3}$. *(Avec l’énoncé d’origine $-3x$ : $x\\left(\\sqrt[3]{1 + \\frac{5}{x} + \\frac{1}{x^3}} - 3\\right)$, le facteur entre parenthèses tend vers $-2$ et $x \\to +\\infty$, donc la limite vaut $-\\infty$.)*","en":"2. Form $\\infty - \\infty$. Set $a = \\sqrt[3]{x^3 + 5x^2 + 1}$, $b = x$: $\\dfrac{a^3 - x^3}{a^2 + ax + x^2} = \\dfrac{5x^2 + 1}{a^2 + ax + x^2}$. With $u = 1 + \\frac{5}{x} + \\frac{1}{x^3}$, $a = x\\,u^{1/3}$, and dividing by $x^2$: $\\dfrac{5 + \\frac{1}{x^2}}{u^{2/3} + u^{1/3} + 1} \\to \\dfrac{5}{3}$."},{"fr":"3. $x \\to -\\infty$ donc $x < 0$. Indice pair : $\\sqrt[4]{x^4 + 1} = |x|\\sqrt[4]{1 + \\frac{1}{x^4}} = -x\\sqrt[4]{1 + \\frac{1}{x^4}}$. On divise par $x$ : $\\dfrac{-\\sqrt[4]{1 + \\frac{1}{x^4}} - \\frac{2}{x}}{1 + \\frac{5}{x}} \\to \\dfrac{-1 - 0}{1 + 0} = -1$.","en":"3. $x \\to -\\infty$ so $x < 0$. Even index: $\\sqrt[4]{x^4 + 1} = |x|\\sqrt[4]{1 + \\frac{1}{x^4}} = -x\\sqrt[4]{1 + \\frac{1}{x^4}}$. Divide by $x$: $\\dfrac{-\\sqrt[4]{1 + \\frac{1}{x^4}} - \\frac{2}{x}}{1 + \\frac{5}{x}} \\to \\dfrac{-1 - 0}{1 + 0} = -1$."}],"apps":[]}]},{"id":"rn-l6","title":["Notes à retenir","Notes to remember","ملاحظات للحفظ"],"steps":[{"id":"s1","t":["8. Notes","8. Notes","8. ملاحظات"],"story":{"fr":"","en":""},"blocks":[{"fr":"• **Indice pair** : racine définie seulement pour un radicande $\\ge 0$, résultat $\\ge 0$, et $\\sqrt[n]{x^n} = |x|$. **Indice impair** : définie sur $\\mathbb{R}$, $\\sqrt[n]{x^n} = x$.","en":"• **Even index**: root defined only for a radicand $\\ge 0$, result $\\ge 0$, and $\\sqrt[n]{x^n} = |x|$. **Odd index**: defined on $\\mathbb{R}$, $\\sqrt[n]{x^n} = x$."},{"fr":"• **Même indice** pour multiplier ou diviser des racines ; sinon, passer aux puissances rationnelles.","en":"• **Same index** to multiply or divide roots; otherwise switch to rational powers."},{"fr":"• $\\sqrt[n]{a+b} \\neq \\sqrt[n]{a} + \\sqrt[n]{b}$.","en":"• $\\sqrt[n]{a+b} \\neq \\sqrt[n]{a} + \\sqrt[n]{b}$."},{"fr":"• Équations avec racines d’indice pair : toujours **vérifier** les solutions.","en":"• Equations with even-index roots: always **check** the solutions."},{"fr":"• Limites : substituer, puis utiliser un conjugué (carré : $a+b$ ; cubique : $a^2+ab+b^2$) ou factoriser le terme dominant.","en":"• Limits: substitute, then use a conjugate (square: $a+b$; cubic: $a^2+ab+b^2$) or factor out the dominant term."}],"apps":[]}]}];
const RNEX=[{"id":"rn-chick-01","d":"ve","p":{"fr":"Calculer $\\sqrt[3]{27}$, $\\sqrt[4]{16}$, $\\sqrt[5]{32}$, $\\sqrt[3]{-8}$, $\\sqrt[6]{64}$.","en":"Compute $\\sqrt[3]{27}$, $\\sqrt[4]{16}$, $\\sqrt[5]{32}$, $\\sqrt[3]{-8}$, $\\sqrt[6]{64}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$3,\\ 2,\\ 2,\\ -2,\\ 2$.","en":"$3,\\ 2,\\ 2,\\ -2,\\ 2$."}]},{"id":"rn-chick-02","d":"ve","p":{"fr":"Écrire sous forme de puissance : $\\sqrt[3]{5}$, $\\sqrt[4]{7}$, $\\sqrt[3]{2^2}$, $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[5]{3}}$.","en":"Write as a power: $\\sqrt[3]{5}$, $\\sqrt[4]{7}$, $\\sqrt[3]{2^2}$, $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[5]{3}}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$5^{1/3},\\ 7^{1/4},\\ 2^{2/3},\\ 3^{-1/5}$.","en":"$5^{1/3},\\ 7^{1/4},\\ 2^{2/3},\\ 3^{-1/5}$."}]},{"id":"rn-chick-03","d":"ve","p":{"fr":"Écrire sous forme de racine : $2^{1/5}$, $7^{3/4}$, $3^{-1/2}$, $10^{2/3}$.","en":"Write as a root: $2^{1/5}$, $7^{3/4}$, $3^{-1/2}$, $10^{2/3}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$\\sqrt[5]{2},\\ \\sqrt[4]{7^3},\\ \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}},\\ \\sqrt[3]{100}$.","en":"$\\sqrt[5]{2},\\ \\sqrt[4]{7^3},\\ \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}},\\ \\sqrt[3]{100}$."}]},{"id":"rn-chick-04","d":"ve","p":{"fr":"Simplifier $\\left(\\sqrt[3]{7}\\right)^3$, $\\left(\\sqrt[5]{3}\\right)^5$, $\\sqrt[4]{2^4}$, $\\sqrt[6]{5^6}$.","en":"Simplify $\\left(\\sqrt[3]{7}\\right)^3$, $\\left(\\sqrt[5]{3}\\right)^5$, $\\sqrt[4]{2^4}$, $\\sqrt[6]{5^6}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$7,\\ 3,\\ 2,\\ 5$.","en":"$7,\\ 3,\\ 2,\\ 5$."}]},{"id":"rn-chick-05","d":"ve","p":{"fr":"Calculer $\\sqrt[3]{8}\\times\\sqrt[3]{27}$, $\\sqrt[4]{\\dfrac{1}{16}}$, $\\sqrt[3]{\\dfrac{64}{125}}$.","en":"Compute $\\sqrt[3]{8}\\times\\sqrt[3]{27}$, $\\sqrt[4]{\\dfrac{1}{16}}$, $\\sqrt[3]{\\dfrac{64}{125}}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$2\\times 3 = 6$ ; $\\dfrac{1}{2}$ ; $\\dfrac{4}{5}$.","en":"$2\\times 3 = 6$; $\\dfrac{1}{2}$; $\\dfrac{4}{5}$."}]},{"id":"rn-chick-06","d":"ve","p":{"fr":"Calculer, si elles existent : $\\sqrt[3]{-64}$, $\\sqrt[4]{-16}$, $\\sqrt[4]{(-3)^4}$, $\\sqrt[3]{(-2)^3}$.","en":"Compute, if they exist: $\\sqrt[3]{-64}$, $\\sqrt[4]{-16}$, $\\sqrt[4]{(-3)^4}$, $\\sqrt[3]{(-2)^3}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$-4$ ; n’existe pas (indice pair, radicande négatif) ; $3$ ; $-2$.","en":"$-4$; does not exist (even index, negative radicand); $3$; $-2$."}]},{"id":"rn-chick-07","d":"ve","p":{"fr":"Simplifier $\\sqrt[3]{16}$, $\\sqrt[3]{54}$, $\\sqrt[4]{48}$, $\\sqrt[3]{250}$.","en":"Simplify $\\sqrt[3]{16}$, $\\sqrt[3]{54}$, $\\sqrt[4]{48}$, $\\sqrt[3]{250}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$2\\sqrt[3]{2},\\ 3\\sqrt[3]{2},\\ 2\\sqrt[4]{3},\\ 5\\sqrt[3]{2}$.","en":"$2\\sqrt[3]{2},\\ 3\\sqrt[3]{2},\\ 2\\sqrt[4]{3},\\ 5\\sqrt[3]{2}$."}]},{"id":"rn-chick-08","d":"ve","p":{"fr":"Calculer $8^{2/3}$, $16^{3/4}$, $27^{-1/3}$, $32^{2/5}$.","en":"Compute $8^{2/3}$, $16^{3/4}$, $27^{-1/3}$, $32^{2/5}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$4,\\ 8,\\ \\dfrac{1}{3},\\ 4$.","en":"$4,\\ 8,\\ \\dfrac{1}{3},\\ 4$."}]},{"id":"rn-chick-09","d":"ve","p":{"fr":"Vrai ou faux ? a) $\\sqrt[3]{-8} = -2$ ; b) $\\sqrt[4]{-16} = -2$ ; c) $\\sqrt[3]{2}\\sqrt[3]{4} = 2$ ; d) $\\sqrt[3]{2} + \\sqrt[3]{3} = \\sqrt[3]{5}$.","en":"True or false? a) $\\sqrt[3]{-8} = -2$; b) $\\sqrt[4]{-16} = -2$; c) $\\sqrt[3]{2}\\sqrt[3]{4} = 2$; d) $\\sqrt[3]{2} + \\sqrt[3]{3} = \\sqrt[3]{5}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"a) vrai ; b) faux (n’existe pas) ; c) vrai ($\\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$) ; d) faux (la somme des racines n’est pas la racine de la somme).","en":"a) true; b) false (does not exist); c) true ($\\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$); d) false (the sum of roots is not the root of the sum)."}]},{"id":"rn-chicken-01","d":"e","p":{"fr":"Calculer $\\sqrt[3]{2}\\sqrt[3]{4}$, $\\sqrt[4]{8}\\sqrt[4]{2}$, $\\sqrt[3]{9}\\sqrt[3]{3}$, $\\sqrt[5]{16}\\sqrt[5]{2}$.","en":"Compute $\\sqrt[3]{2}\\sqrt[3]{4}$, $\\sqrt[4]{8}\\sqrt[4]{2}$, $\\sqrt[3]{9}\\sqrt[3]{3}$, $\\sqrt[5]{16}\\sqrt[5]{2}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$\\sqrt[3]{8}=2,\\ \\sqrt[4]{16}=2,\\ \\sqrt[3]{27}=3,\\ \\sqrt[5]{32}=2$.","en":"$\\sqrt[3]{8}=2,\\ \\sqrt[4]{16}=2,\\ \\sqrt[3]{27}=3,\\ \\sqrt[5]{32}=2$."}]},{"id":"rn-chicken-02","d":"e","p":{"fr":"Simplifier $\\sqrt[4]{3}\\sqrt{3}$, $\\sqrt[3]{4}\\sqrt{2}$, $\\sqrt[6]{2}\\sqrt[3]{2}$, $\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{64}}$.","en":"Simplify $\\sqrt[4]{3}\\sqrt{3}$, $\\sqrt[3]{4}\\sqrt{2}$, $\\sqrt[6]{2}\\sqrt[3]{2}$, $\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{64}}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$3^{1/4+1/2} = 3^{3/4} = \\sqrt[4]{27}$ ; $2^{2/3+1/2} = 2^{7/6} = 2\\sqrt[6]{2}$ ; $2^{1/6+1/3} = 2^{1/2} = \\sqrt{2}$ ; $\\sqrt[6]{64} = 2$.","en":"$3^{1/4+1/2} = 3^{3/4} = \\sqrt[4]{27}$; $2^{2/3+1/2} = 2^{7/6} = 2\\sqrt[6]{2}$; $2^{1/6+1/3} = 2^{1/2} = \\sqrt{2}$; $\\sqrt[6]{64} = 2$."}]},{"id":"rn-chicken-03","d":"e","p":{"fr":"Calculer $\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{729}}$ et $\\sqrt[4]{\\sqrt[3]{4096}}$.","en":"Compute $\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{729}}$ and $\\sqrt[4]{\\sqrt[3]{4096}}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$\\sqrt[6]{729} = \\sqrt[6]{3^6} = 3$ ; $\\sqrt[12]{2^{12}} = 2$.","en":"$\\sqrt[6]{729} = \\sqrt[6]{3^6} = 3$; $\\sqrt[12]{2^{12}} = 2$."}]},{"id":"rn-chicken-04","d":"e","p":{"fr":"Simplifier $\\sqrt[3]{2^7}$, $\\sqrt[4]{3^9}$, $\\sqrt[5]{2^{12}}$, et $\\sqrt[3]{x^7}$ pour $x \\ge 0$.","en":"Simplify $\\sqrt[3]{2^7}$, $\\sqrt[4]{3^9}$, $\\sqrt[5]{2^{12}}$, and $\\sqrt[3]{x^7}$ for $x \\ge 0$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$2^7 = 2^6\\cdot 2$ donc $4\\sqrt[3]{2}$ ; $9\\sqrt[4]{3}$ ; $2^{12} = 2^{10}\\cdot 2^2$ donc $4\\sqrt[5]{4}$ ; $x^2\\sqrt[3]{x}$.","en":"$2^7 = 2^6\\cdot 2$ so $4\\sqrt[3]{2}$; $9\\sqrt[4]{3}$; $2^{12} = 2^{10}\\cdot 2^2$ so $4\\sqrt[5]{4}$; $x^2\\sqrt[3]{x}$."}]},{"id":"rn-chicken-05","d":"e","p":{"fr":"Simplifier $\\sqrt[3]{24} + \\sqrt[3]{81} - \\sqrt[3]{3}$ et $\\sqrt[4]{32} + \\sqrt[4]{2}$.","en":"Simplify $\\sqrt[3]{24} + \\sqrt[3]{81} - \\sqrt[3]{3}$ and $\\sqrt[4]{32} + \\sqrt[4]{2}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$2\\sqrt[3]{3} + 3\\sqrt[3]{3} - \\sqrt[3]{3} = 4\\sqrt[3]{3}$ ; $2\\sqrt[4]{2} + \\sqrt[4]{2} = 3\\sqrt[4]{2}$.","en":"$2\\sqrt[3]{3} + 3\\sqrt[3]{3} - \\sqrt[3]{3} = 4\\sqrt[3]{3}$; $2\\sqrt[4]{2} + \\sqrt[4]{2} = 3\\sqrt[4]{2}$."}]},{"id":"rn-chicken-06","d":"e","p":{"fr":"Rationaliser le dénominateur : $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{2}}$, $\\dfrac{6}{\\sqrt[3]{4}}$, $\\dfrac{3}{\\sqrt[4]{3}}$.","en":"Rationalise the denominator: $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{2}}$, $\\dfrac{6}{\\sqrt[3]{4}}$, $\\dfrac{3}{\\sqrt[4]{3}}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt[3]{4}}{2}$ ; $\\dfrac{6\\sqrt[3]{2}}{2} = 3\\sqrt[3]{2}$ ; $\\dfrac{3\\sqrt[4]{27}}{3} = \\sqrt[4]{27}$.","en":"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt[3]{4}}{2}$; $\\dfrac{6\\sqrt[3]{2}}{2} = 3\\sqrt[3]{2}$; $\\dfrac{3\\sqrt[4]{27}}{3} = \\sqrt[4]{27}$."}]},{"id":"rn-chicken-07","d":"e","p":{"fr":"Comparer : a) $\\sqrt[3]{2}$ et $\\sqrt[6]{5}$ ; b) $\\sqrt{3}$ et $\\sqrt[3]{5}$ ; c) $\\sqrt[3]{3}$ et $\\sqrt[4]{5}$.","en":"Compare: a) $\\sqrt[3]{2}$ and $\\sqrt[6]{5}$; b) $\\sqrt{3}$ and $\\sqrt[3]{5}$; c) $\\sqrt[3]{3}$ and $\\sqrt[4]{5}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"a) indice 6 : $\\sqrt[6]{4} < \\sqrt[6]{5}$ donc $\\sqrt[3]{2} < \\sqrt[6]{5}$. b) $\\sqrt[6]{27} > \\sqrt[6]{25}$ donc $\\sqrt{3} > \\sqrt[3]{5}$. c) indice 12 : $\\sqrt[12]{81} < \\sqrt[12]{125}$ donc $\\sqrt[3]{3} < \\sqrt[4]{5}$.","en":"a) index 6: $\\sqrt[6]{4} < \\sqrt[6]{5}$ so $\\sqrt[3]{2} < \\sqrt[6]{5}$. b) $\\sqrt[6]{27} > \\sqrt[6]{25}$ so $\\sqrt{3} > \\sqrt[3]{5}$. c) index 12: $\\sqrt[12]{81} < \\sqrt[12]{125}$ so $\\sqrt[3]{3} < \\sqrt[4]{5}$."}]},{"id":"rn-chicken-08","d":"e","p":{"fr":"Résoudre dans $\\mathbb{R}$: $x^3 = 27$ ; $x^3 = -64$ ; $x^4 = 81$ ; $x^5 = -32$ ; $x^6 = -1$.","en":"Solve in $\\mathbb{R}$: $x^3 = 27$; $x^3 = -64$; $x^4 = 81$; $x^5 = -32$; $x^6 = -1$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$S=\\{3\\}$ ; $S=\\{-4\\}$ ; $S=\\{-3,3\\}$ ; $S=\\{-2\\}$ ; $S=\\emptyset$.","en":"$S=\\{3\\}$; $S=\\{-4\\}$; $S=\\{-3,3\\}$; $S=\\{-2\\}$; $S=\\emptyset$."}]},{"id":"rn-chicken-09","d":"e","p":{"fr":"Calculer $2^{1/2}\\times 2^{3/2}$, $\\left(3^{2/3}\\right)^{3/2}$, $\\dfrac{81^{3/4}}{9^{1/2}}$, $4^{1/3}\\times 2^{1/3}$.","en":"Compute $2^{1/2}\\times 2^{3/2}$, $\\left(3^{2/3}\\right)^{3/2}$, $\\dfrac{81^{3/4}}{9^{1/2}}$, $4^{1/3}\\times 2^{1/3}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$2^2 = 4$ ; $3$ ; $\\dfrac{27}{3} = 9$ ; $8^{1/3} = 2$.","en":"$2^2 = 4$; $3$; $\\dfrac{27}{3} = 9$; $8^{1/3} = 2$."}]},{"id":"rn-raven-01","d":"m","p":{"fr":"Résoudre : a) $\\sqrt[3]{2x-1} = 3$ ; b) $\\sqrt[3]{x+5} = -2$ ; c) $\\sqrt[4]{3x+1} = 2$ ; d) $\\sqrt[5]{x^2-1} = 1$.","en":"Solve: a) $\\sqrt[3]{2x-1} = 3$; b) $\\sqrt[3]{x+5} = -2$; c) $\\sqrt[4]{3x+1} = 2$; d) $\\sqrt[5]{x^2-1} = 1$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"a) $2x-1 = 27$, $S=\\{14\\}$. b) $x+5=-8$, $S=\\{-13\\}$. c) $3x+1 = 16$, $x=5$ ✓, $S=\\{5\\}$. d) $x^2 = 2$, $S=\\{-\\sqrt{2},\\sqrt{2}\\}$.","en":"a) $2x-1 = 27$, $S=\\{14\\}$. b) $x+5=-8$, $S=\\{-13\\}$. c) $3x+1 = 16$, $x=5$ ✓, $S=\\{5\\}$. d) $x^2 = 2$, $S=\\{-\\sqrt{2},\\sqrt{2}\\}$."}]},{"id":"rn-raven-02","d":"m","p":{"fr":"Résoudre : a) $x^3 - 27 = 0$ ; b) $x^3 + 8 = 0$ ; c) $8x^3 - 1 = 0$ ; d) $x^4 - 81 = 0$.","en":"Solve: a) $x^3 - 27 = 0$; b) $x^3 + 8 = 0$; c) $8x^3 - 1 = 0$; d) $x^4 - 81 = 0$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"a) $(x-3)(x^2+3x+9)$, $\\Delta<0$, $S=\\{3\\}$. b) $(x+2)(x^2-2x+4)$, $\\Delta<0$, $S=\\{-2\\}$. c) $(2x-1)(4x^2+2x+1)$, $\\Delta = 4-16<0$, $S=\\left\\{\\tfrac12\\right\\}$. d) $S=\\{-3,3\\}$.","en":"a) $(x-3)(x^2+3x+9)$, $\\Delta<0$, $S=\\{3\\}$. b) $(x+2)(x^2-2x+4)$, $\\Delta<0$, $S=\\{-2\\}$. c) $(2x-1)(4x^2+2x+1)$, $\\Delta = 4-16<0$, $S=\\left\\{\\tfrac12\\right\\}$. d) $S=\\{-3,3\\}$."}]},{"id":"rn-raven-03","d":"m","p":{"fr":"Résoudre : a) $\\sqrt{x+2} = x$ ; b) $\\sqrt{2x-1} = x-2$ ; c) $\\sqrt{x+1} = x-1$.","en":"Solve: a) $\\sqrt{x+2} = x$; b) $\\sqrt{2x-1} = x-2$; c) $\\sqrt{x+1} = x-1$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"a) $x^2 - x - 2 = 0$, $x=2$ ou $-1$ ; $x\\ge 0$ donc $S=\\{2\\}$. b) $x \\ge 2$ ; $x^2 - 6x + 5 = 0$, $x = 1$ (rejeté) ou $5$ ($\\sqrt{9} = 3$ ✓), $S=\\{5\\}$. c) $x \\ge 1$ ; $x^2 - 3x = 0$, $x = 0$ (rejeté) ou $3$ ($\\sqrt{4} = 2$ ✓), $S=\\{3\\}$.","en":"a) $x^2 - x - 2 = 0$, $x=2$ or $-1$; $x\\ge 0$ so $S=\\{2\\}$. b) $x \\ge 2$; $x^2 - 6x + 5 = 0$, $x = 1$ (rejected) or $5$ ($\\sqrt{9} = 3$ ✓), $S=\\{5\\}$. c) $x \\ge 1$; $x^2 - 3x = 0$, $x = 0$ (rejected) or $3$ ($\\sqrt{4} = 2$ ✓), $S=\\{3\\}$."}]},{"id":"rn-raven-04","d":"m","p":{"fr":"Résoudre $\\sqrt[3]{x^2 - 2x} = 2$.","en":"Solve $\\sqrt[3]{x^2 - 2x} = 2$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$x^2 - 2x - 8 = 0$, $(x-4)(x+2) = 0$. Vérification : $16-8 = 8$ ✓ et $4+4 = 8$ ✓. $S=\\{-2,4\\}$.","en":"$x^2 - 2x - 8 = 0$, $(x-4)(x+2) = 0$. Check: $16-8 = 8$ ✓ and $4+4 = 8$ ✓. $S=\\{-2,4\\}$."}]},{"id":"rn-raven-05","d":"m","p":{"fr":"Résoudre $\\sqrt[4]{x^2 - 9} = 2$.","en":"Solve $\\sqrt[4]{x^2 - 9} = 2$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"condition $x^2 \\ge 9$. $x^2 - 9 = 16$, $x = \\pm 5$ ✓. $S=\\{-5,5\\}$.","en":"condition $x^2 \\ge 9$. $x^2 - 9 = 16$, $x = \\pm 5$ ✓. $S=\\{-5,5\\}$."}]},{"id":"rn-raven-06","d":"m","p":{"fr":"Résoudre $\\sqrt[3]{x+6} = x$.","en":"Solve $\\sqrt[3]{x+6} = x$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$x^3 - x - 6 = 0$. $x=2$ est racine : $(x-2)(x^2+2x+3) = 0$, $\\Delta = 4-12<0$. $\\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$ ✓. $S=\\{2\\}$.","en":"$x^3 - x - 6 = 0$. $x=2$ is a root: $(x-2)(x^2+2x+3) = 0$, $\\Delta = 4-12<0$. $\\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$ ✓. $S=\\{2\\}$."}]},{"id":"rn-raven-07","d":"m","p":{"fr":"Résoudre : a) $\\sqrt[3]{x-1} < 2$ ; b) $\\sqrt{2x-1} \\le 3$ ; c) $\\sqrt[4]{x+3} > 1$.","en":"Solve: a) $\\sqrt[3]{x-1} < 2$; b) $\\sqrt{2x-1} \\le 3$; c) $\\sqrt[4]{x+3} > 1$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"a) $x - 1 < 8$: $]-\\infty, 9[$. b) $0 \\le 2x-1 \\le 9$: $\\left[\\tfrac12, 5\\right]$. c) $x+3 > 1$: $]-2, +\\infty[$.","en":"a) $x - 1 < 8$: $]-\\infty, 9[$. b) $0 \\le 2x-1 \\le 9$: $\\left[\\tfrac12, 5\\right]$. c) $x+3 > 1$: $]-2, +\\infty[$."}]},{"id":"rn-raven-08","d":"m","p":{"fr":"Domaine de définition de : $f(x) = \\sqrt[3]{x^2-4}$ ; $g(x) = \\sqrt[4]{x^2-4}$ ; $h(x) = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{x-1}}$ ; $k(x) = \\dfrac{\\sqrt[4]{x}}{x-2}$.","en":"Domain of: $f(x) = \\sqrt[3]{x^2-4}$; $g(x) = \\sqrt[4]{x^2-4}$; $h(x) = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{x-1}}$; $k(x) = \\dfrac{\\sqrt[4]{x}}{x-2}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$D_f = \\mathbb{R}$ ; $D_g = ]-\\infty,-2] \\cup [2,+\\infty[$ ; $D_h = \\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\{1\\}$ ; $D_k = [0,2[\\,\\cup\\,]2,+\\infty[$.","en":"$D_f = \\mathbb{R}$; $D_g = ]-\\infty,-2] \\cup [2,+\\infty[$; $D_h = \\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\{1\\}$; $D_k = [0,2[\\,\\cup\\,]2,+\\infty[$."}]},{"id":"rn-raven-09","d":"m","p":{"fr":"Limites : a) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to-\\infty}\\sqrt[3]{x}$ ; b) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{5}{\\sqrt[4]{x}}$ ; c) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 8}\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x}+x\\right)$ ; d) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0^+}\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[4]{x}}$.","en":"Limits: a) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to-\\infty}\\sqrt[3]{x}$; b) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{5}{\\sqrt[4]{x}}$; c) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 8}\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x}+x\\right)$; d) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0^+}\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[4]{x}}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"a) $-\\infty$ ; b) $0$ ; c) $2 + 8 = 10$ ; d) $+\\infty$.","en":"a) $-\\infty$; b) $0$; c) $2 + 8 = 10$; d) $+\\infty$."}]},{"id":"rn-eagle-01","d":"h","p":{"fr":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 7}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+1}-2}{x-7}$.","en":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 7}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+1}-2}{x-7}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$\\dfrac{0}{0}$. Avec $a = \\sqrt[3]{x+1}$, $b=2$: $\\dfrac{x-7}{(x-7)(a^2+2a+4)} = \\dfrac{1}{a^2+2a+4} \\to \\dfrac{1}{12}$.","en":"$\\dfrac{0}{0}$. With $a = \\sqrt[3]{x+1}$, $b=2$: $\\dfrac{x-7}{(x-7)(a^2+2a+4)} = \\dfrac{1}{a^2+2a+4} \\to \\dfrac{1}{12}$."}],"blocks":[{"fr":"**Avertissements propres à ce niveau.** (1) Le conjugué d’une racine cubique est $a^2 + ab + b^2$, **et non** $a+b$. (2) En $-\\infty$, $\\sqrt{x^2} = |x| = -x$ et $\\sqrt[4]{x^4} = |x|$ : attention au signe. (3) Essayer d’abord la substitution : n’utiliser un conjugué que si la forme est indéterminée.","en":"**Warnings specific to this level.** (1) The conjugate of a cube root is $a^2 + ab + b^2$, **not** $a+b$. (2) At $-\\infty$, $\\sqrt{x^2} = |x| = -x$ and $\\sqrt[4]{x^4} = |x|$: watch the sign. (3) Try substitution first: only use a conjugate if the form is indeterminate."}]},{"id":"rn-eagle-02","d":"h","p":{"fr":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 1}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+3}-2}{x-1}$.","en":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 1}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+3}-2}{x-1}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$\\dfrac{(x+3)-4}{(x-1)\\left(\\sqrt{x+3}+2\\right)} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{x+3}+2} \\to \\dfrac{1}{4}$.","en":"$\\dfrac{(x+3)-4}{(x-1)\\left(\\sqrt{x+3}+2\\right)} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{x+3}+2} \\to \\dfrac{1}{4}$."}]},{"id":"rn-eagle-03","d":"h","p":{"fr":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{27+3x}-3}{x}$.","en":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{27+3x}-3}{x}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"avec $a=\\sqrt[3]{27+3x}$, $b=3$: $\\dfrac{3x}{x(a^2+3a+9)} = \\dfrac{3}{a^2+3a+9} \\to \\dfrac{3}{27} = \\dfrac{1}{9}$.","en":"with $a=\\sqrt[3]{27+3x}$, $b=3$: $\\dfrac{3x}{x(a^2+3a+9)} = \\dfrac{3}{a^2+3a+9} \\to \\dfrac{3}{27} = \\dfrac{1}{9}$."}]},{"id":"rn-eagle-04","d":"h","p":{"fr":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 2}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+6}-2}{x^2-4}$.","en":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 2}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+6}-2}{x^2-4}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"le numérateur devient $\\dfrac{x-2}{a^2+2a+4}$ ; donc $\\dfrac{1}{(x+2)(a^2+2a+4)} \\to \\dfrac{1}{4\\times 12} = \\dfrac{1}{48}$.","en":"the numerator becomes $\\dfrac{x-2}{a^2+2a+4}$; so $\\dfrac{1}{(x+2)(a^2+2a+4)} \\to \\dfrac{1}{4\\times 12} = \\dfrac{1}{48}$."}]},{"id":"rn-eagle-05","d":"h","p":{"fr":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+x}-x\\right)$.","en":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+x}-x\\right)$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+x}+x} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{x}}+1} \\to \\dfrac{1}{2}$.","en":"$\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+x}+x} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{x}}+1} \\to \\dfrac{1}{2}$."}]},{"id":"rn-eagle-06","d":"h","p":{"fr":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+x}+x\\right)$.","en":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+x}+x\\right)$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+x}-x}$. Pour $x<0$: $\\sqrt{x^2+x} = -x\\sqrt{1+\\frac1x}$, donc le dénominateur vaut $-x\\left(\\sqrt{1+\\frac1x}+1\\right)$ et le quotient vaut $\\dfrac{-1}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac1x}+1} \\to -\\dfrac{1}{2}$.","en":"$\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+x}-x}$. For $x<0$: $\\sqrt{x^2+x} = -x\\sqrt{1+\\frac1x}$, so the denominator equals $-x\\left(\\sqrt{1+\\frac1x}+1\\right)$ and the quotient is $\\dfrac{-1}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac1x}+1} \\to -\\dfrac{1}{2}$."}]},{"id":"rn-eagle-07","d":"h","p":{"fr":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x^3+x^2}-x\\right)$.","en":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x^3+x^2}-x\\right)$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$a = \\sqrt[3]{x^3+x^2}$: $\\dfrac{x^2}{a^2+ax+x^2}$. Comme $a \\sim x$, le dénominateur est $\\sim 3x^2$: la limite vaut $\\dfrac{1}{3}$.","en":"$a = \\sqrt[3]{x^3+x^2}$: $\\dfrac{x^2}{a^2+ax+x^2}$. Since $a \\sim x$, the denominator is $\\sim 3x^2$: the limit is $\\dfrac{1}{3}$."}]},{"id":"rn-eagle-08","d":"h","p":{"fr":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x+1}-\\sqrt[3]{x}\\right)$.","en":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x+1}-\\sqrt[3]{x}\\right)$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$a=\\sqrt[3]{x+1}$, $b=\\sqrt[3]{x}$: $a-b = \\dfrac{1}{a^2+ab+b^2} \\to 0$.","en":"$a=\\sqrt[3]{x+1}$, $b=\\sqrt[3]{x}$: $a-b = \\dfrac{1}{a^2+ab+b^2} \\to 0$."}]},{"id":"rn-eagle-09","d":"h","p":{"fr":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\frac{\\sqrt[4]{16x^4+1}}{x}$ et $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{\\sqrt[4]{16x^4+1}}{x}$.","en":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\frac{\\sqrt[4]{16x^4+1}}{x}$ and $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{\\sqrt[4]{16x^4+1}}{x}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$\\sqrt[4]{16x^4+1} = |x|\\sqrt[4]{16+\\frac{1}{x^4}}$. En $-\\infty$: $-\\sqrt[4]{16+\\frac{1}{x^4}} \\to -2$. En $+\\infty$: $\\to 2$.","en":"$\\sqrt[4]{16x^4+1} = |x|\\sqrt[4]{16+\\frac{1}{x^4}}$. At $-\\infty$: $-\\sqrt[4]{16+\\frac{1}{x^4}} \\to -2$. At $+\\infty$: $\\to 2$."}]},{"id":"rn-phoenix-01","d":"x","p":{"fr":"Montrer que $x = \\sqrt[3]{2+\\sqrt{5}} + \\sqrt[3]{2-\\sqrt{5}}$ vaut $1$.","en":"Show that $x = \\sqrt[3]{2+\\sqrt{5}} + \\sqrt[3]{2-\\sqrt{5}}$ equals $1$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$x^3 = 4 + 3\\sqrt[3]{(2+\\sqrt5)(2-\\sqrt5)}\\,x = 4 + 3\\sqrt[3]{-1}\\,x = 4 - 3x$. Donc $x^3 + 3x - 4 = (x-1)(x^2+x+4) = 0$ avec $\\Delta = 1-16<0$. Donc $x = 1$.","en":"$x^3 = 4 + 3\\sqrt[3]{(2+\\sqrt5)(2-\\sqrt5)}\\,x = 4 + 3\\sqrt[3]{-1}\\,x = 4 - 3x$. So $x^3 + 3x - 4 = (x-1)(x^2+x+4) = 0$ with $\\Delta = 1-16<0$. Hence $x = 1$."}]},{"id":"rn-phoenix-02","d":"x","p":{"fr":"Simplifier $\\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt2}$, $\\sqrt{7-4\\sqrt3}$, alors $A = \\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt2}+\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt2}$.","en":"Simplify $\\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt2}$, $\\sqrt{7-4\\sqrt3}$, then $A = \\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt2}+\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt2}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$(1+\\sqrt2)^2 = 3+2\\sqrt2$ donc $\\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt2} = 1+\\sqrt2$. $(2-\\sqrt3)^2 = 7-4\\sqrt3$ et $2-\\sqrt3>0$ donc $\\sqrt{7-4\\sqrt3} = 2-\\sqrt3$. De même $\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt2} = \\sqrt2-1$, donc $A = 2\\sqrt2$.","en":"$(1+\\sqrt2)^2 = 3+2\\sqrt2$ so $\\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt2} = 1+\\sqrt2$. $(2-\\sqrt3)^2 = 7-4\\sqrt3$ and $2-\\sqrt3>0$ so $\\sqrt{7-4\\sqrt3} = 2-\\sqrt3$. Likewise $\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt2} = \\sqrt2-1$, so $A = 2\\sqrt2$."}]},{"id":"rn-phoenix-03","d":"x","p":{"fr":"Montrer que $\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt5+2}-\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt5-2} = 1$.","en":"Show that $\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt5+2}-\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt5-2} = 1$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$x^3 = 4 - 3\\sqrt[3]{(\\sqrt5+2)(\\sqrt5-2)}\\,x = 4 - 3x$ car $(\\sqrt5+2)(\\sqrt5-2) = 1$. Même équation que PHOENIX-01, donc $x=1$.","en":"$x^3 = 4 - 3\\sqrt[3]{(\\sqrt5+2)(\\sqrt5-2)}\\,x = 4 - 3x$ since $(\\sqrt5+2)(\\sqrt5-2) = 1$. Same equation as PHOENIX-01, so $x=1$."}]},{"id":"rn-phoenix-04","d":"x","p":{"fr":"Résoudre $\\sqrt{x+3}+\\sqrt{x-2} = 5$.","en":"Solve $\\sqrt{x+3}+\\sqrt{x-2} = 5$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"condition $x \\ge 2$. $\\sqrt{x+3} = 5 - \\sqrt{x-2}$ donne $x+3 = 25 - 10\\sqrt{x-2} + x - 2$, i.e. $\\sqrt{x-2} = 2$, $x = 6$. Vérification : $3 + 2 = 5$ ✓. $S=\\{6\\}$.","en":"condition $x \\ge 2$. $\\sqrt{x+3} = 5 - \\sqrt{x-2}$ gives $x+3 = 25 - 10\\sqrt{x-2} + x - 2$, i.e. $\\sqrt{x-2} = 2$, $x = 6$. Check: $3 + 2 = 5$ ✓. $S=\\{6\\}$."}]},{"id":"rn-phoenix-05","d":"x","p":{"fr":"Résoudre $\\sqrt[3]{x^2} - 3\\sqrt[3]{x} + 2 = 0$.","en":"Solve $\\sqrt[3]{x^2} - 3\\sqrt[3]{x} + 2 = 0$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$t = \\sqrt[3]{x}$: $t^2 - 3t + 2 = 0$, $t = 1$ ou $2$, donc $x = 1$ ou $8$. Vérification pour $8$: $4 - 6 + 2 = 0$ ✓. $S=\\{1,8\\}$.","en":"$t = \\sqrt[3]{x}$: $t^2 - 3t + 2 = 0$, $t = 1$ or $2$, so $x = 1$ or $8$. Check for $8$: $4 - 6 + 2 = 0$ ✓. $S=\\{1,8\\}$."}]},{"id":"rn-phoenix-06","d":"x","p":{"fr":"Résoudre $\\sqrt{x} - 2\\sqrt[4]{x} - 3 = 0$.","en":"Solve $\\sqrt{x} - 2\\sqrt[4]{x} - 3 = 0$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$t = \\sqrt[4]{x} \\ge 0$: $t^2 - 2t - 3 = 0$, $t = 3$ ou $-1$ ; seul $t=3$ convient. $x = 81$ ($9 - 6 - 3 = 0$ ✓). $S=\\{81\\}$.","en":"$t = \\sqrt[4]{x} \\ge 0$: $t^2 - 2t - 3 = 0$, $t = 3$ or $-1$; only $t=3$ works. $x = 81$ ($9 - 6 - 3 = 0$ ✓). $S=\\{81\\}$."}]},{"id":"rn-phoenix-07","d":"x","p":{"fr":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{x+\\sqrt{x}}-\\sqrt{x}\\right)$.","en":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{x+\\sqrt{x}}-\\sqrt{x}\\right)$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{x+\\sqrt x}+\\sqrt x} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt x}}+1} \\to \\dfrac{1}{2}$.","en":"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{x+\\sqrt x}+\\sqrt x} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt x}}+1} \\to \\dfrac{1}{2}$."}]},{"id":"rn-phoenix-08","d":"x","p":{"fr":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{1+x}-\\sqrt{1+x}}{x}$.","en":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{1+x}-\\sqrt{1+x}}{x}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"écrire $\\dfrac{\\sqrt[3]{1+x}-1}{x} - \\dfrac{\\sqrt{1+x}-1}{x} \\to \\dfrac13 - \\dfrac12 = -\\dfrac16$.","en":"write $\\dfrac{\\sqrt[3]{1+x}-1}{x} - \\dfrac{\\sqrt{1+x}-1}{x} \\to \\dfrac13 - \\dfrac12 = -\\dfrac16$."}]},{"id":"rn-phoenix-09","d":"x","p":{"fr":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 1}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x}-1}{\\sqrt[4]{x}-1}$.","en":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 1}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x}-1}{\\sqrt[4]{x}-1}$."},"q":"","sol":[{"fr":"$u = \\sqrt[12]{x} \\to 1$: $\\dfrac{u^4-1}{u^3-1} = \\dfrac{(u-1)(u^3+u^2+u+1)}{(u-1)(u^2+u+1)} \\to \\dfrac{4}{3}$.","en":"$u = \\sqrt[12]{x} \\to 1$: $\\dfrac{u^4-1}{u^3-1} = \\dfrac{(u-1)(u^3+u^2+u+1)}{(u-1)(u^2+u+1)} \\to \\dfrac{4}{3}$."}]}];
RNEX.forEach(e=>{e.ex=true;EXB[e.id]=e});
Object.assign(ARX,{"We know $x \\mapsto x^2$ and its inverse $x \\mapsto \\sqrt{x}$. For every integer $n \\ge 1$, the function $x \\mapsto x^n$ also has an inverse, the **$n$-th root** $\\sqrt[n]{x}$:":"نعرف الدالة $x \\mapsto x^2$ وعكسها $x \\mapsto \\sqrt{x}$. لكل عدد صحيح $n \\ge 1$، للدالة $x \\mapsto x^n$ أيضًا دالة عكسية هي **الجذر من الرتبة $n$**، $\\sqrt[n]{x}$:","• inverse of $x^3$: the cube root $\\sqrt[3]{x}$;":"• عكس $x^3$: الجذر التكعيبي $\\sqrt[3]{x}$؛","• inverse of $x^4$: the fourth root $\\sqrt[4]{x}$;":"• عكس $x^4$: الجذر الرابع $\\sqrt[4]{x}$؛","• inverse of $x^{1000}$: the $1000$-th root $\\sqrt[1000]{x}$.":"• عكس $x^{1000}$: الجذر من الرتبة $1000$، $\\sqrt[1000]{x}$.","Let $n \\in \\mathbb{N}^*$. The function $f : x \\mapsto x^n$ defined on $I = [0, +\\infty[$ has an inverse function $f^{-1}$ defined on $J = f(I) = [0, +\\infty[$. It is called the **$n$-th root function**, denoted $\\sqrt[n]{\\ }$:":"ليكن $n \\in \\mathbb{N}^*$. الدالة $f : x \\mapsto x^n$ المعرفة على $I = [0, +\\infty[$ تقبل دالة عكسية $f^{-1}$ معرفة على $J = f(I) = [0, +\\infty[$. تسمى **دالة الجذر من الرتبة $n$** ونرمز لها بـ $\\sqrt[n]{\\ }$:","$\\displaystyle \\forall x \\ge 0,\\ \\forall y \\ge 0 : \\quad x^n = y \\iff x = \\sqrt[n]{y}$":"$\\displaystyle \\forall x \\ge 0,\\ \\forall y \\ge 0 : \\quad x^n = y \\iff x = \\sqrt[n]{y}$","**Remark: roots of odd index.** If $n$ is **odd**, $x \\mapsto x^n$ is a bijection from $\\mathbb{R}$ to $\\mathbb{R}$. The root $\\sqrt[n]{x}$ is then defined for **every** real number and $\\sqrt[n]{-x} = -\\sqrt[n]{x}$ (example: $\\sqrt[3]{-8} = -2$). If $n$ is **even**, $\\sqrt[n]{x}$ exists only for $x \\ge 0$. This remark is used throughout the course (equations, limits at $-\\infty$).":"**ملاحظة: الجذور ذات الدليل الفردي.** إذا كان $n$ **فرديًا** فإن $x \\mapsto x^n$ تقابل من $\\mathbb{R}$ نحو $\\mathbb{R}$. يكون الجذر $\\sqrt[n]{x}$ إذن معرفًا على **كل** الأعداد الحقيقية و $\\sqrt[n]{-x} = -\\sqrt[n]{x}$ (مثال: $\\sqrt[3]{-8} = -2$). أما إذا كان $n$ **زوجيًا** فإن $\\sqrt[n]{x}$ لا يوجد إلا إذا كان $x \\ge 0$. تُستعمل هذه الملاحظة في كل الدرس (المعادلات، النهايات عند $-\\infty$).","For $x \\ge 0$, $y > 0$ and $n, p, q \\in \\mathbb{N}^*$:":"لكل $x \\ge 0$ و $y > 0$ و $n, p, q \\in \\mathbb{N}^*$:","**Rational powers.** For $a > 0$, $b > 0$ and $r, r' \\in \\mathbb{Q}$:":"**القوى الجذرية (الأسس الكسرية).** لكل $a > 0$ و $b > 0$ و $r, r' \\in \\mathbb{Q}$:","• $a^r \\times a^{r'} = a^{r+r'}$ and $\\dfrac{a^r}{a^{r'}} = a^{r-r'}$":"• $a^r \\times a^{r'} = a^{r+r'}$ و $\\dfrac{a^r}{a^{r'}} = a^{r-r'}$","• $(a^r)^{r'} = a^{rr'}$":"• $(a^r)^{r'} = a^{rr'}$","• $(ab)^r = a^r b^r$ and $\\left(\\dfrac{a}{b}\\right)^r = \\dfrac{a^r}{b^r}$":"• $(ab)^r = a^r b^r$ و $\\left(\\dfrac{a}{b}\\right)^r = \\dfrac{a^r}{b^r}$","• $a^{-r} = \\dfrac{1}{a^r}$":"• $a^{-r} = \\dfrac{1}{a^r}$","• if $r = \\dfrac{p}{q}$ with $p \\in \\mathbb{Z}$, $q \\in \\mathbb{N}^*$: $a^{p/q} = \\sqrt[q]{a^p}$":"• إذا كان $r = \\dfrac{p}{q}$ مع $p \\in \\mathbb{Z}$ و $q \\in \\mathbb{N}^*$: $a^{p/q} = \\sqrt[q]{a^p}$","**Key idea:** turn each root into a power, $\\sqrt[n]{a^m} = a^{m/n}$, then use the rules for powers.":"**الفكرة الأساسية:** نحول كل جذر إلى قوة، $\\sqrt[n]{a^m} = a^{m/n}$، ثم نستعمل قواعد القوى.","For $a, b \\ge 0$: $\\sqrt[n]{a}\\,\\sqrt[n]{b} = \\sqrt[n]{ab}$ and $\\dfrac{\\sqrt[n]{a}}{\\sqrt[n]{b}} = \\sqrt[n]{\\dfrac{a}{b}}$ (**the index must be the same**), $\\left(\\sqrt[n]{a}\\right)^n = a$, $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[m]{a}} = \\sqrt[nm]{a}$.":"لكل $a, b \\ge 0$: $\\sqrt[n]{a}\\,\\sqrt[n]{b} = \\sqrt[n]{ab}$ و $\\dfrac{\\sqrt[n]{a}}{\\sqrt[n]{b}} = \\sqrt[n]{\\dfrac{a}{b}}$ (**يجب أن يكون الدليل نفسه**)، $\\left(\\sqrt[n]{a}\\right)^n = a$، $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[m]{a}} = \\sqrt[nm]{a}$.","**Three steps:**":"**ثلاث خطوات:**","1. **Decompose** the number under the root: $625 = 5^4$, $1024 = 2^{10}$, $16 = 2^4$.":"1. **حلّل** العدد تحت الجذر: $625 = 5^4$، $1024 = 2^{10}$، $16 = 2^4$.","2. **Simplify** when the exponent equals the index: $\\sqrt[4]{5^4} = 5$.":"2. **بسّط** عندما يساوي الأس الدليل: $\\sqrt[4]{5^4} = 5$.","3. **Reduce to the same index** (common multiple) to compare or multiply roots with different indices.":"3. **وحّد الدليل** (مضاعف مشترك) لمقارنة أو ضرب جذور ذات أدلة مختلفة.","**Statement:** $A = \\sqrt[3]{54} + \\sqrt[3]{16} - \\sqrt[3]{128}$; $B = \\sqrt[4]{81} \\times \\sqrt[3]{8} - \\sqrt[5]{32}$; $C = \\sqrt[3]{2} \\times \\sqrt[6]{4}$; $D = \\dfrac{\\sqrt[4]{3^6} \\times \\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt[6]{3^9}}$.":"**النص:** $A = \\sqrt[3]{54} + \\sqrt[3]{16} - \\sqrt[3]{128}$؛ $B = \\sqrt[4]{81} \\times \\sqrt[3]{8} - \\sqrt[5]{32}$؛ $C = \\sqrt[3]{2} \\times \\sqrt[6]{4}$؛ $D = \\dfrac{\\sqrt[4]{3^6} \\times \\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt[6]{3^9}}$.","**Solution:**":"**الحل:**","• **A.** $\\sqrt[3]{54} = 3\\sqrt[3]{2}$, $\\sqrt[3]{16} = 2\\sqrt[3]{2}$, $\\sqrt[3]{128} = 4\\sqrt[3]{2}$, so $A = (3 + 2 - 4)\\sqrt[3]{2} = \\sqrt[3]{2}$.":"• **A.** $\\sqrt[3]{54} = 3\\sqrt[3]{2}$، $\\sqrt[3]{16} = 2\\sqrt[3]{2}$، $\\sqrt[3]{128} = 4\\sqrt[3]{2}$، إذن $A = (3 + 2 - 4)\\sqrt[3]{2} = \\sqrt[3]{2}$.","• **B.** $\\sqrt[4]{81} = 3$, $\\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$, $\\sqrt[5]{32} = 2$, so $B = 3 \\times 2 - 2 = 4$.":"• **B.** $\\sqrt[4]{81} = 3$، $\\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$، $\\sqrt[5]{32} = 2$، إذن $B = 3 \\times 2 - 2 = 4$.","• **C.** $\\sqrt[6]{4} = 2^{2/6} = 2^{1/3}$, so $C = 2^{1/3} \\times 2^{1/3} = 2^{2/3} = \\sqrt[3]{4}$.":"• **C.** $\\sqrt[6]{4} = 2^{2/6} = 2^{1/3}$، إذن $C = 2^{1/3} \\times 2^{1/3} = 2^{2/3} = \\sqrt[3]{4}$.","• **D.** $3^{6/4} = 3^{3/2}$, $\\sqrt{3} = 3^{1/2}$, $3^{9/6} = 3^{3/2}$, so $D = \\dfrac{3^{3/2} \\times 3^{1/2}}{3^{3/2}} = 3^{1/2} = \\sqrt{3}$.":"• **D.** $3^{6/4} = 3^{3/2}$، $\\sqrt{3} = 3^{1/2}$، $3^{9/6} = 3^{3/2}$، إذن $D = \\dfrac{3^{3/2} \\times 3^{1/2}}{3^{3/2}} = 3^{1/2} = \\sqrt{3}$.","**Statement:** a) $\\sqrt[3]{3}$, $\\sqrt{2}$, $\\sqrt[6]{10}$; b) $\\sqrt[3]{2}$, $\\sqrt[4]{5}$, $\\sqrt{3}$.":"**النص:** a) $\\sqrt[3]{3}$، $\\sqrt{2}$، $\\sqrt[6]{10}$؛ b) $\\sqrt[3]{2}$، $\\sqrt[4]{5}$، $\\sqrt{3}$.","• **a)** Index $6$: $\\sqrt[3]{3} = \\sqrt[6]{9}$, $\\sqrt{2} = \\sqrt[6]{8}$, $\\sqrt[6]{10}$. Since $8 < 9 < 10$: $\\sqrt{2} < \\sqrt[3]{3} < \\sqrt[6]{10}$.":"• **a)** الدليل $6$: $\\sqrt[3]{3} = \\sqrt[6]{9}$، $\\sqrt{2} = \\sqrt[6]{8}$، $\\sqrt[6]{10}$. بما أن $8 < 9 < 10$: $\\sqrt{2} < \\sqrt[3]{3} < \\sqrt[6]{10}$.","• **b)** Index $12$: $\\sqrt[3]{2} = \\sqrt[12]{2^4} = \\sqrt[12]{16}$, $\\sqrt[4]{5} = \\sqrt[12]{5^3} = \\sqrt[12]{125}$, $\\sqrt{3} = \\sqrt[12]{3^6} = \\sqrt[12]{729}$. Since $16 < 125 < 729$: $\\sqrt[3]{2} < \\sqrt[4]{5} < \\sqrt{3}$.":"• **b)** الدليل $12$: $\\sqrt[3]{2} = \\sqrt[12]{2^4} = \\sqrt[12]{16}$، $\\sqrt[4]{5} = \\sqrt[12]{5^3} = \\sqrt[12]{125}$، $\\sqrt{3} = \\sqrt[12]{3^6} = \\sqrt[12]{729}$. بما أن $16 < 125 < 729$: $\\sqrt[3]{2} < \\sqrt[4]{5} < \\sqrt{3}$.","$\\displaystyle a^3 + b^3 = (a+b)(a^2 - ab + b^2) \\qquad a^3 - b^3 = (a-b)(a^2 + ab + b^2)$":"$\\displaystyle a^3 + b^3 = (a+b)(a^2 - ab + b^2) \\qquad a^3 - b^3 = (a-b)(a^2 + ab + b^2)$","The second factor $a^2 \\pm ab + b^2$ vanishes only if $a = b = 0$ (for fixed $b \\neq 0$, its discriminant is $-3b^2 < 0$). In equations, **only the first factor** gives real solutions.":"العامل الثاني $a^2 \\pm ab + b^2$ لا ينعدم إلا إذا كان $a = b = 0$ (من أجل $b \\neq 0$ ثابت، مميزه هو $-3b^2 < 0$). في المعادلات، **العامل الأول فقط** يعطي حلولًا حقيقية.","**Method in 5 steps:**":"**المنهجية في 5 خطوات:**","1. **Existence condition.** Even index (square root): the radicand must be $\\ge 0$. Odd index (cube root): no condition.":"1. **شرط الوجود.** الدليل الزوجي (الجذر المربع): يجب أن يكون ما تحت الجذر $\\ge 0$. الدليل الفردي (الجذر التكعيبي): لا يوجد شرط.","2. **Isolate** the root on one side of the $=$ sign.":"2. **اعزل** الجذر في طرف من علامة $=$.","3. **Raise to the power $n$** on both sides ($n$ = index): $\\left(\\sqrt[n]{A}\\right)^n = A$.":"3. **ارفع إلى القوة $n$** الطرفين ($n$ = الدليل): $\\left(\\sqrt[n]{A}\\right)^n = A$.","4. **Solve** the resulting equation (factorisation, identities, discriminant $\\Delta$).":"4. **حلّ** المعادلة الناتجة (التحليل إلى عوامل، المتطابقات، المميز $\\Delta$).","5. **Check every solution.** Mandatory for even indices: squaring can create false solutions.":"5. **تحقق من كل حل.** إجباري في حالة الأدلة الزوجية: الرفع إلى القوة قد يُنتج حلولًا دخيلة.","**Case $x^n = a$:**":"**الحالة $x^n = a$:**","• $n$ odd: a single solution, $x = \\sqrt[n]{a}$ (whatever the sign of $a$).":"• $n$ فردي: حل وحيد، $x = \\sqrt[n]{a}$ (مهما كانت إشارة $a$).","• $n$ even and $a > 0$: two solutions, $x = \\pm\\sqrt[n]{a}$.":"• $n$ زوجي و $a > 0$: حلان، $x = \\pm\\sqrt[n]{a}$.","• $n$ even and $a < 0$: no solution.":"• $n$ زوجي و $a < 0$: لا يوجد حل.","**Case $x^3 \\pm a^3 = 0$:** use the identities, then check that the second factor has $\\Delta < 0$.":"**الحالة $x^3 \\pm a^3 = 0$:** نستعمل المتطابقات، ثم نتحقق من أن العامل الثاني مميزه $\\Delta < 0$.","**Statement:** $E_1 : x^3 - 64 = 0$; $E_2 : x^3 + 125 = 0$; $E_3 : \\sqrt[3]{x^2 - x + 2} = 2$; $E_4 : \\sqrt{2x+3} = x$; $E_5 : x^4 - 16 = 0$.":"**النص:** $E_1 : x^3 - 64 = 0$؛ $E_2 : x^3 + 125 = 0$؛ $E_3 : \\sqrt[3]{x^2 - x + 2} = 2$؛ $E_4 : \\sqrt{2x+3} = x$؛ $E_5 : x^4 - 16 = 0$.","• $E_1$: $x^3 - 4^3 = (x-4)(x^2 + 4x + 16) = 0$. For the 2nd factor, $\\Delta = 16 - 64 < 0$. $S = \\{4\\}$.":"• $E_1$: $x^3 - 4^3 = (x-4)(x^2 + 4x + 16) = 0$. بالنسبة للعامل الثاني، $\\Delta = 16 - 64 < 0$. $S = \\{4\\}$.","• $E_2$: $x^3 + 5^3 = (x+5)(x^2 - 5x + 25) = 0$. For the 2nd factor, $\\Delta = 25 - 100 < 0$. $S = \\{-5\\}$.":"• $E_2$: $x^3 + 5^3 = (x+5)(x^2 - 5x + 25) = 0$. بالنسبة للعامل الثاني، $\\Delta = 25 - 100 < 0$. $S = \\{-5\\}$.","• $E_3$: no condition (index $3$). Cube both sides: $x^2 - x + 2 = 8$, so $x^2 - x - 6 = 0$, $\\Delta = 25$, $x = \\dfrac{1 \\pm 5}{2}$, i.e. $x = 3$ or $x = -2$. Check: $9 - 3 + 2 = 8$ ✓ and $4 + 2 + 2 = 8$ ✓. $S = \\{-2, 3\\}$.":"• $E_3$: لا شرط (الدليل $3$). نرفع إلى القوة 3: $x^2 - x + 2 = 8$، إذن $x^2 - x - 6 = 0$، $\\Delta = 25$، $x = \\dfrac{1 \\pm 5}{2}$، أي $x = 3$ أو $x = -2$. التحقق: $9 - 3 + 2 = 8$ ✓ و $4 + 2 + 2 = 8$ ✓. $S = \\{-2, 3\\}$.","• $E_4$: conditions $2x + 3 \\ge 0$ and $x \\ge 0$ (a square root is non-negative). Square both sides: $2x + 3 = x^2$, so $(x-3)(x+1) = 0$. $x = 3$ works ($\\sqrt{9} = 3$ ✓). $x = -1$ is rejected ($x \\ge 0$ fails: $\\sqrt{1} = 1 \\neq -1$). $S = \\{3\\}$.":"• $E_4$: الشروط $2x + 3 \\ge 0$ و $x \\ge 0$ (الجذر المربع موجب). نربّع: $2x + 3 = x^2$، إذن $(x-3)(x+1) = 0$. $x = 3$ مقبول ($\\sqrt{9} = 3$ ✓). $x = -1$ مرفوض (الشرط $x \\ge 0$ غير محقق: $\\sqrt{1} = 1 \\neq -1$). $S = \\{3\\}$.","• $E_5$: $x^4 = 16$ with $n = 4$ even and $16 > 0$, so $x = \\pm\\sqrt[4]{16} = \\pm 2$. $S = \\{-2, 2\\}$.":"• $E_5$: $x^4 = 16$ مع $n = 4$ زوجي و $16 > 0$، إذن $x = \\pm\\sqrt[4]{16} = \\pm 2$. $S = \\{-2, 2\\}$.","**Remember.** For a limit with a square root, first substitute $x$. If you get an indeterminate form ($\\frac{0}{0}$ or $\\infty - \\infty$), multiply by the **conjugate**. For a cube root, the conjugate is no longer $(a+b)$: use $a^3 - b^3 = (a-b)(a^2 + ab + b^2)$.":"**تذكّر.** في نهاية تحتوي على جذر مربع، نعوّض $x$ أولًا. إذا حصلنا على حالة عدم تعيين ($\\frac{0}{0}$ أو $\\infty - \\infty$) نضرب في **المرافق**. بالنسبة للجذر التكعيبي، لم يعد المرافق هو $(a+b)$: نستعمل $a^3 - b^3 = (a-b)(a^2 + ab + b^2)$.","For an expression $\\sqrt[3]{A} - b$: set $a = \\sqrt[3]{A}$, multiply top and bottom by $a^2 + ab + b^2$ (the **cubic conjugate**), and the numerator becomes $a^3 - b^3 = A - b^3$, with no root left.":"من أجل تعبير من الشكل $\\sqrt[3]{A} - b$: نضع $a = \\sqrt[3]{A}$، ونضرب البسط والمقام في $a^2 + ab + b^2$ (**المرافق التكعيبي**)، فيصبح البسط $a^3 - b^3 = A - b^3$، دون أي جذر.","**Steps:**":"**الخطوات:**","1. Substitute the value of $x$. If the form is indeterminate, go to step 2.":"1. عوّض $x$ بالقيمة. إذا كانت الحالة غير معينة، انتقل إلى الخطوة 2.","2. Multiply by the conjugate (square or cubic).":"2. اضرب في المرافق (المربع أو التكعيبي).","3. Simplify: the factor that cancels the denominator disappears.":"3. بسّط: العامل الذي يعدم المقام يختفي.","4. Substitute again.":"4. عوّض من جديد.","**At $\\pm\\infty$**, you can also factor out the dominant term. Careful: $\\sqrt[4]{x^4} = |x|$ (even index), whereas $\\sqrt[3]{x^3} = x$ (odd index).":"**عند $\\pm\\infty$** يمكن أيضًا إخراج الحد المهيمن كعامل مشترك. انتبه: $\\sqrt[4]{x^4} = |x|$ (دليل زوجي)، بينما $\\sqrt[3]{x^3} = x$ (دليل فردي).","**Example:** $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+1} - 1}{x}$. At $0$: $\\frac{0}{0}$. Set $a = \\sqrt[3]{x+1}$, $b = 1$, and multiply by $a^2 + a + 1$:":"**مثال:** $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+1} - 1}{x}$. عند $0$: $\\frac{0}{0}$. نضع $a = \\sqrt[3]{x+1}$، $b = 1$، ونضرب في $a^2 + a + 1$:","$\\displaystyle \\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+1} - 1}{x} = \\frac{(x+1) - 1}{x\\left(\\sqrt[3]{(x+1)^2} + \\sqrt[3]{x+1} + 1\\right)} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{(x+1)^2} + \\sqrt[3]{x+1} + 1} \\xrightarrow[x \\to 0]{} \\frac{1}{3}$":"$\\displaystyle \\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+1} - 1}{x} = \\frac{(x+1) - 1}{x\\left(\\sqrt[3]{(x+1)^2} + \\sqrt[3]{x+1} + 1\\right)} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{(x+1)^2} + \\sqrt[3]{x+1} + 1} \\xrightarrow[x \\to 0]{} \\frac{1}{3}$","**Beyond the syllabus but good to know: differentiating an $n$-th root.** Write $\\sqrt[n]{u} = u^{1/n}$ and differentiate like a power: $(u^\\alpha)' = \\alpha\\, u^{\\alpha - 1}\\, u'$. Example: $g(x) = \\sqrt[3]{x^2 + 1} = (x^2+1)^{1/3}$, so $g'(x) = \\dfrac{1}{3}(x^2+1)^{-2/3} \\cdot 2x = \\dfrac{2x}{3\\sqrt[3]{(x^2+1)^2}}$.":"**خارج المقرر لكن مفيد: اشتقاق جذر من الرتبة $n$.** نكتب $\\sqrt[n]{u} = u^{1/n}$ ونشتق كقوة: $(u^\\alpha)' = \\alpha\\, u^{\\alpha - 1}\\, u'$. مثال: $g(x) = \\sqrt[3]{x^2 + 1} = (x^2+1)^{1/3}$، إذن $g'(x) = \\dfrac{1}{3}(x^2+1)^{-2/3} \\cdot 2x = \\dfrac{2x}{3\\sqrt[3]{(x^2+1)^2}}$.","**Statement:**":"**النص:**","1. $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{\\sqrt[3]{9x-1} - 2}{x - 1}$":"1. $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{\\sqrt[3]{9x-1} - 2}{x - 1}$","2. $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to +\\infty} \\left(\\sqrt[3]{x^3 + 5x^2 + 1} - x\\right)$":"2. $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to +\\infty} \\left(\\sqrt[3]{x^3 + 5x^2 + 1} - x\\right)$","3. $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to -\\infty} \\frac{\\sqrt[4]{x^4 + 1} - 2}{x + 5}$":"3. $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to -\\infty} \\frac{\\sqrt[4]{x^4 + 1} - 2}{x + 5}$","1. At $x = 1$: $\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{8} - 2}{0} = \\frac{0}{0}$. Set $a = \\sqrt[3]{9x-1}$, $b = 2$, conjugate $a^2 + 2a + 4$: $\\dfrac{(9x-1) - 8}{(x-1)(a^2 + 2a + 4)} = \\dfrac{9}{a^2 + 2a + 4} \\to \\dfrac{9}{12} = \\dfrac{3}{4}$.":"1. عند $x = 1$: $\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{8} - 2}{0} = \\frac{0}{0}$. نضع $a = \\sqrt[3]{9x-1}$، $b = 2$، والمرافق $a^2 + 2a + 4$: $\\dfrac{(9x-1) - 8}{(x-1)(a^2 + 2a + 4)} = \\dfrac{9}{a^2 + 2a + 4} \\to \\dfrac{9}{12} = \\dfrac{3}{4}$.","2. Form $\\infty - \\infty$. Set $a = \\sqrt[3]{x^3 + 5x^2 + 1}$, $b = x$: $\\dfrac{a^3 - x^3}{a^2 + ax + x^2} = \\dfrac{5x^2 + 1}{a^2 + ax + x^2}$. With $u = 1 + \\frac{5}{x} + \\frac{1}{x^3}$, $a = x\\,u^{1/3}$, and dividing by $x^2$: $\\dfrac{5 + \\frac{1}{x^2}}{u^{2/3} + u^{1/3} + 1} \\to \\dfrac{5}{3}$.":"2. الشكل $\\infty - \\infty$. نضع $a = \\sqrt[3]{x^3 + 5x^2 + 1}$، $b = x$: $\\dfrac{a^3 - x^3}{a^2 + ax + x^2} = \\dfrac{5x^2 + 1}{a^2 + ax + x^2}$. مع $u = 1 + \\frac{5}{x} + \\frac{1}{x^3}$ و $a = x\\,u^{1/3}$، وبالقسمة على $x^2$: $\\dfrac{5 + \\frac{1}{x^2}}{u^{2/3} + u^{1/3} + 1} \\to \\dfrac{5}{3}$.","3. $x \\to -\\infty$ so $x < 0$. Even index: $\\sqrt[4]{x^4 + 1} = |x|\\sqrt[4]{1 + \\frac{1}{x^4}} = -x\\sqrt[4]{1 + \\frac{1}{x^4}}$. Divide by $x$: $\\dfrac{-\\sqrt[4]{1 + \\frac{1}{x^4}} - \\frac{2}{x}}{1 + \\frac{5}{x}} \\to \\dfrac{-1 - 0}{1 + 0} = -1$.":"3. $x \\to -\\infty$ إذن $x < 0$. الدليل زوجي: $\\sqrt[4]{x^4 + 1} = |x|\\sqrt[4]{1 + \\frac{1}{x^4}} = -x\\sqrt[4]{1 + \\frac{1}{x^4}}$. نقسم على $x$: $\\dfrac{-\\sqrt[4]{1 + \\frac{1}{x^4}} - \\frac{2}{x}}{1 + \\frac{5}{x}} \\to \\dfrac{-1 - 0}{1 + 0} = -1$.","• **Even index**: root defined only for a radicand $\\ge 0$, result $\\ge 0$, and $\\sqrt[n]{x^n} = |x|$. **Odd index**: defined on $\\mathbb{R}$, $\\sqrt[n]{x^n} = x$.":"• **الدليل الزوجي**: الجذر معرف فقط إذا كان ما تحت الجذر $\\ge 0$، والنتيجة $\\ge 0$، و $\\sqrt[n]{x^n} = |x|$. **الدليل الفردي**: معرف على $\\mathbb{R}$، و $\\sqrt[n]{x^n} = x$.","• **Same index** to multiply or divide roots; otherwise switch to rational powers.":"• **نفس الدليل** من أجل ضرب أو قسمة الجذور؛ وإلا ننتقل إلى القوى الجذرية.","• $\\sqrt[n]{a+b} \\neq \\sqrt[n]{a} + \\sqrt[n]{b}$.":"• $\\sqrt[n]{a+b} \\neq \\sqrt[n]{a} + \\sqrt[n]{b}$.","• Equations with even-index roots: always **check** the solutions.":"• المعادلات ذات الجذور من دليل زوجي: **تحقق** دائمًا من الحلول.","• Limits: substitute, then use a conjugate (square: $a+b$; cubic: $a^2+ab+b^2$) or factor out the dominant term.":"• النهايات: عوّض، ثم استعمل المرافق (المربع: $a+b$؛ التكعيبي: $a^2+ab+b^2$) أو أخرج الحد المهيمن كعامل مشترك.","Compute $\\sqrt[3]{27}$, $\\sqrt[4]{16}$, $\\sqrt[5]{32}$, $\\sqrt[3]{-8}$, $\\sqrt[6]{64}$.":"احسب $\\sqrt[3]{27}$، $\\sqrt[4]{16}$، $\\sqrt[5]{32}$، $\\sqrt[3]{-8}$، $\\sqrt[6]{64}$.","$3,\\ 2,\\ 2,\\ -2,\\ 2$.":"$3,\\ 2,\\ 2,\\ -2,\\ 2$.","Write as a power: $\\sqrt[3]{5}$, $\\sqrt[4]{7}$, $\\sqrt[3]{2^2}$, $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[5]{3}}$.":"اكتب على شكل قوة: $\\sqrt[3]{5}$، $\\sqrt[4]{7}$، $\\sqrt[3]{2^2}$، $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[5]{3}}$.","$5^{1/3},\\ 7^{1/4},\\ 2^{2/3},\\ 3^{-1/5}$.":"$5^{1/3},\\ 7^{1/4},\\ 2^{2/3},\\ 3^{-1/5}$.","Write as a root: $2^{1/5}$, $7^{3/4}$, $3^{-1/2}$, $10^{2/3}$.":"اكتب على شكل جذر: $2^{1/5}$، $7^{3/4}$، $3^{-1/2}$، $10^{2/3}$.","$\\sqrt[5]{2},\\ \\sqrt[4]{7^3},\\ \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}},\\ \\sqrt[3]{100}$.":"$\\sqrt[5]{2},\\ \\sqrt[4]{7^3},\\ \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}},\\ \\sqrt[3]{100}$.","Simplify $\\left(\\sqrt[3]{7}\\right)^3$, $\\left(\\sqrt[5]{3}\\right)^5$, $\\sqrt[4]{2^4}$, $\\sqrt[6]{5^6}$.":"بسّط $\\left(\\sqrt[3]{7}\\right)^3$، $\\left(\\sqrt[5]{3}\\right)^5$، $\\sqrt[4]{2^4}$، $\\sqrt[6]{5^6}$.","$7,\\ 3,\\ 2,\\ 5$.":"$7,\\ 3,\\ 2,\\ 5$.","Compute $\\sqrt[3]{8}\\times\\sqrt[3]{27}$, $\\sqrt[4]{\\dfrac{1}{16}}$, $\\sqrt[3]{\\dfrac{64}{125}}$.":"احسب $\\sqrt[3]{8}\\times\\sqrt[3]{27}$، $\\sqrt[4]{\\dfrac{1}{16}}$، $\\sqrt[3]{\\dfrac{64}{125}}$.","$2\\times 3 = 6$; $\\dfrac{1}{2}$; $\\dfrac{4}{5}$.":"$2\\times 3 = 6$؛ $\\dfrac{1}{2}$؛ $\\dfrac{4}{5}$.","Compute, if they exist: $\\sqrt[3]{-64}$, $\\sqrt[4]{-16}$, $\\sqrt[4]{(-3)^4}$, $\\sqrt[3]{(-2)^3}$.":"احسب إن أمكن: $\\sqrt[3]{-64}$، $\\sqrt[4]{-16}$، $\\sqrt[4]{(-3)^4}$، $\\sqrt[3]{(-2)^3}$.","$-4$; does not exist (even index, negative radicand); $3$; $-2$.":"$-4$؛ غير موجود (دليل زوجي وما تحت الجذر سالب)؛ $3$؛ $-2$.","Simplify $\\sqrt[3]{16}$, $\\sqrt[3]{54}$, $\\sqrt[4]{48}$, $\\sqrt[3]{250}$.":"بسّط $\\sqrt[3]{16}$، $\\sqrt[3]{54}$، $\\sqrt[4]{48}$، $\\sqrt[3]{250}$.","$2\\sqrt[3]{2},\\ 3\\sqrt[3]{2},\\ 2\\sqrt[4]{3},\\ 5\\sqrt[3]{2}$.":"$2\\sqrt[3]{2},\\ 3\\sqrt[3]{2},\\ 2\\sqrt[4]{3},\\ 5\\sqrt[3]{2}$.","Compute $8^{2/3}$, $16^{3/4}$, $27^{-1/3}$, $32^{2/5}$.":"احسب $8^{2/3}$، $16^{3/4}$، $27^{-1/3}$، $32^{2/5}$.","$4,\\ 8,\\ \\dfrac{1}{3},\\ 4$.":"$4,\\ 8,\\ \\dfrac{1}{3},\\ 4$.","True or false? a) $\\sqrt[3]{-8} = -2$; b) $\\sqrt[4]{-16} = -2$; c) $\\sqrt[3]{2}\\sqrt[3]{4} = 2$; d) $\\sqrt[3]{2} + \\sqrt[3]{3} = \\sqrt[3]{5}$.":"صحيح أم خطأ؟ a) $\\sqrt[3]{-8} = -2$؛ b) $\\sqrt[4]{-16} = -2$؛ c) $\\sqrt[3]{2}\\sqrt[3]{4} = 2$؛ d) $\\sqrt[3]{2} + \\sqrt[3]{3} = \\sqrt[3]{5}$.","a) true; b) false (does not exist); c) true ($\\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$); d) false (the sum of roots is not the root of the sum).":"a) صحيح؛ b) خطأ (غير موجود)؛ c) صحيح ($\\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$)؛ d) خطأ (مجموع الجذور ليس جذر المجموع).","Compute $\\sqrt[3]{2}\\sqrt[3]{4}$, $\\sqrt[4]{8}\\sqrt[4]{2}$, $\\sqrt[3]{9}\\sqrt[3]{3}$, $\\sqrt[5]{16}\\sqrt[5]{2}$.":"احسب $\\sqrt[3]{2}\\sqrt[3]{4}$، $\\sqrt[4]{8}\\sqrt[4]{2}$، $\\sqrt[3]{9}\\sqrt[3]{3}$، $\\sqrt[5]{16}\\sqrt[5]{2}$.","$\\sqrt[3]{8}=2,\\ \\sqrt[4]{16}=2,\\ \\sqrt[3]{27}=3,\\ \\sqrt[5]{32}=2$.":"$\\sqrt[3]{8}=2,\\ \\sqrt[4]{16}=2,\\ \\sqrt[3]{27}=3,\\ \\sqrt[5]{32}=2$.","Simplify $\\sqrt[4]{3}\\sqrt{3}$, $\\sqrt[3]{4}\\sqrt{2}$, $\\sqrt[6]{2}\\sqrt[3]{2}$, $\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{64}}$.":"بسّط $\\sqrt[4]{3}\\sqrt{3}$، $\\sqrt[3]{4}\\sqrt{2}$، $\\sqrt[6]{2}\\sqrt[3]{2}$، $\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{64}}$.","$3^{1/4+1/2} = 3^{3/4} = \\sqrt[4]{27}$; $2^{2/3+1/2} = 2^{7/6} = 2\\sqrt[6]{2}$; $2^{1/6+1/3} = 2^{1/2} = \\sqrt{2}$; $\\sqrt[6]{64} = 2$.":"$3^{1/4+1/2} = 3^{3/4} = \\sqrt[4]{27}$؛ $2^{2/3+1/2} = 2^{7/6} = 2\\sqrt[6]{2}$؛ $2^{1/6+1/3} = 2^{1/2} = \\sqrt{2}$؛ $\\sqrt[6]{64} = 2$.","Compute $\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{729}}$ and $\\sqrt[4]{\\sqrt[3]{4096}}$.":"احسب $\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{729}}$ و $\\sqrt[4]{\\sqrt[3]{4096}}$.","$\\sqrt[6]{729} = \\sqrt[6]{3^6} = 3$; $\\sqrt[12]{2^{12}} = 2$.":"$\\sqrt[6]{729} = \\sqrt[6]{3^6} = 3$؛ $\\sqrt[12]{2^{12}} = 2$.","Simplify $\\sqrt[3]{2^7}$, $\\sqrt[4]{3^9}$, $\\sqrt[5]{2^{12}}$, and $\\sqrt[3]{x^7}$ for $x \\ge 0$.":"بسّط $\\sqrt[3]{2^7}$، $\\sqrt[4]{3^9}$، $\\sqrt[5]{2^{12}}$، و $\\sqrt[3]{x^7}$ من أجل $x \\ge 0$.","$2^7 = 2^6\\cdot 2$ so $4\\sqrt[3]{2}$; $9\\sqrt[4]{3}$; $2^{12} = 2^{10}\\cdot 2^2$ so $4\\sqrt[5]{4}$; $x^2\\sqrt[3]{x}$.":"$2^7 = 2^6\\cdot 2$ إذن $4\\sqrt[3]{2}$؛ $9\\sqrt[4]{3}$؛ $2^{12} = 2^{10}\\cdot 2^2$ إذن $4\\sqrt[5]{4}$؛ $x^2\\sqrt[3]{x}$.","Simplify $\\sqrt[3]{24} + \\sqrt[3]{81} - \\sqrt[3]{3}$ and $\\sqrt[4]{32} + \\sqrt[4]{2}$.":"بسّط $\\sqrt[3]{24} + \\sqrt[3]{81} - \\sqrt[3]{3}$ و $\\sqrt[4]{32} + \\sqrt[4]{2}$.","$2\\sqrt[3]{3} + 3\\sqrt[3]{3} - \\sqrt[3]{3} = 4\\sqrt[3]{3}$; $2\\sqrt[4]{2} + \\sqrt[4]{2} = 3\\sqrt[4]{2}$.":"$2\\sqrt[3]{3} + 3\\sqrt[3]{3} - \\sqrt[3]{3} = 4\\sqrt[3]{3}$؛ $2\\sqrt[4]{2} + \\sqrt[4]{2} = 3\\sqrt[4]{2}$.","Rationalise the denominator: $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{2}}$, $\\dfrac{6}{\\sqrt[3]{4}}$, $\\dfrac{3}{\\sqrt[4]{3}}$.":"اجعل المقام عددًا جذريًا (ناطقًا): $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{2}}$، $\\dfrac{6}{\\sqrt[3]{4}}$، $\\dfrac{3}{\\sqrt[4]{3}}$.","$\\dfrac{\\sqrt[3]{4}}{2}$; $\\dfrac{6\\sqrt[3]{2}}{2} = 3\\sqrt[3]{2}$; $\\dfrac{3\\sqrt[4]{27}}{3} = \\sqrt[4]{27}$.":"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt[3]{4}}{2}$؛ $\\dfrac{6\\sqrt[3]{2}}{2} = 3\\sqrt[3]{2}$؛ $\\dfrac{3\\sqrt[4]{27}}{3} = \\sqrt[4]{27}$.","Compare: a) $\\sqrt[3]{2}$ and $\\sqrt[6]{5}$; b) $\\sqrt{3}$ and $\\sqrt[3]{5}$; c) $\\sqrt[3]{3}$ and $\\sqrt[4]{5}$.":"قارن: a) $\\sqrt[3]{2}$ و $\\sqrt[6]{5}$؛ b) $\\sqrt{3}$ و $\\sqrt[3]{5}$؛ c) $\\sqrt[3]{3}$ و $\\sqrt[4]{5}$.","a) index 6: $\\sqrt[6]{4} < \\sqrt[6]{5}$ so $\\sqrt[3]{2} < \\sqrt[6]{5}$. b) $\\sqrt[6]{27} > \\sqrt[6]{25}$ so $\\sqrt{3} > \\sqrt[3]{5}$. c) index 12: $\\sqrt[12]{81} < \\sqrt[12]{125}$ so $\\sqrt[3]{3} < \\sqrt[4]{5}$.":"a) الدليل 6: $\\sqrt[6]{4} < \\sqrt[6]{5}$ إذن $\\sqrt[3]{2} < \\sqrt[6]{5}$. b) $\\sqrt[6]{27} > \\sqrt[6]{25}$ إذن $\\sqrt{3} > \\sqrt[3]{5}$. c) الدليل 12: $\\sqrt[12]{81} < \\sqrt[12]{125}$ إذن $\\sqrt[3]{3} < \\sqrt[4]{5}$.","Solve in $\\mathbb{R}$: $x^3 = 27$; $x^3 = -64$; $x^4 = 81$; $x^5 = -32$; $x^6 = -1$.":"حل في $\\mathbb{R}$: $x^3 = 27$؛ $x^3 = -64$؛ $x^4 = 81$؛ $x^5 = -32$؛ $x^6 = -1$.","$S=\\{3\\}$; $S=\\{-4\\}$; $S=\\{-3,3\\}$; $S=\\{-2\\}$; $S=\\emptyset$.":"$S=\\{3\\}$؛ $S=\\{-4\\}$؛ $S=\\{-3,3\\}$؛ $S=\\{-2\\}$؛ $S=\\emptyset$.","Compute $2^{1/2}\\times 2^{3/2}$, $\\left(3^{2/3}\\right)^{3/2}$, $\\dfrac{81^{3/4}}{9^{1/2}}$, $4^{1/3}\\times 2^{1/3}$.":"احسب $2^{1/2}\\times 2^{3/2}$، $\\left(3^{2/3}\\right)^{3/2}$، $\\dfrac{81^{3/4}}{9^{1/2}}$، $4^{1/3}\\times 2^{1/3}$.","$2^2 = 4$; $3$; $\\dfrac{27}{3} = 9$; $8^{1/3} = 2$.":"$2^2 = 4$؛ $3$؛ $\\dfrac{27}{3} = 9$؛ $8^{1/3} = 2$.","Solve: a) $\\sqrt[3]{2x-1} = 3$; b) $\\sqrt[3]{x+5} = -2$; c) $\\sqrt[4]{3x+1} = 2$; d) $\\sqrt[5]{x^2-1} = 1$.":"حل: a) $\\sqrt[3]{2x-1} = 3$؛ b) $\\sqrt[3]{x+5} = -2$؛ c) $\\sqrt[4]{3x+1} = 2$؛ d) $\\sqrt[5]{x^2-1} = 1$.","a) $2x-1 = 27$, $S=\\{14\\}$. b) $x+5=-8$, $S=\\{-13\\}$. c) $3x+1 = 16$, $x=5$ ✓, $S=\\{5\\}$. d) $x^2 = 2$, $S=\\{-\\sqrt{2},\\sqrt{2}\\}$.":"a) $2x-1 = 27$، $S=\\{14\\}$. b) $x+5=-8$، $S=\\{-13\\}$. c) $3x+1 = 16$، $x=5$ ✓، $S=\\{5\\}$. d) $x^2 = 2$، $S=\\{-\\sqrt{2},\\sqrt{2}\\}$.","Solve: a) $x^3 - 27 = 0$; b) $x^3 + 8 = 0$; c) $8x^3 - 1 = 0$; d) $x^4 - 81 = 0$.":"حل: a) $x^3 - 27 = 0$؛ b) $x^3 + 8 = 0$؛ c) $8x^3 - 1 = 0$؛ d) $x^4 - 81 = 0$.","a) $(x-3)(x^2+3x+9)$, $\\Delta<0$, $S=\\{3\\}$. b) $(x+2)(x^2-2x+4)$, $\\Delta<0$, $S=\\{-2\\}$. c) $(2x-1)(4x^2+2x+1)$, $\\Delta = 4-16<0$, $S=\\left\\{\\tfrac12\\right\\}$. d) $S=\\{-3,3\\}$.":"a) $(x-3)(x^2+3x+9)$، $\\Delta<0$، $S=\\{3\\}$. b) $(x+2)(x^2-2x+4)$، $\\Delta<0$، $S=\\{-2\\}$. c) $(2x-1)(4x^2+2x+1)$، $\\Delta = 4-16<0$، $S=\\left\\{\\tfrac12\\right\\}$. d) $S=\\{-3,3\\}$.","Solve: a) $\\sqrt{x+2} = x$; b) $\\sqrt{2x-1} = x-2$; c) $\\sqrt{x+1} = x-1$.":"حل: a) $\\sqrt{x+2} = x$؛ b) $\\sqrt{2x-1} = x-2$؛ c) $\\sqrt{x+1} = x-1$.","a) $x^2 - x - 2 = 0$, $x=2$ or $-1$; $x\\ge 0$ so $S=\\{2\\}$. b) $x \\ge 2$; $x^2 - 6x + 5 = 0$, $x = 1$ (rejected) or $5$ ($\\sqrt{9} = 3$ ✓), $S=\\{5\\}$. c) $x \\ge 1$; $x^2 - 3x = 0$, $x = 0$ (rejected) or $3$ ($\\sqrt{4} = 2$ ✓), $S=\\{3\\}$.":"a) $x^2 - x - 2 = 0$، $x=2$ أو $-1$؛ $x\\ge 0$ إذن $S=\\{2\\}$. b) $x \\ge 2$؛ $x^2 - 6x + 5 = 0$، $x = 1$ (مرفوض) أو $5$ ($\\sqrt{9} = 3$ ✓)، $S=\\{5\\}$. c) $x \\ge 1$؛ $x^2 - 3x = 0$، $x = 0$ (مرفوض) أو $3$ ($\\sqrt{4} = 2$ ✓)، $S=\\{3\\}$.","Solve $\\sqrt[3]{x^2 - 2x} = 2$.":"حل $\\sqrt[3]{x^2 - 2x} = 2$.","$x^2 - 2x - 8 = 0$, $(x-4)(x+2) = 0$. Check: $16-8 = 8$ ✓ and $4+4 = 8$ ✓. $S=\\{-2,4\\}$.":"$x^2 - 2x - 8 = 0$، $(x-4)(x+2) = 0$. التحقق: $16-8 = 8$ ✓ و $4+4 = 8$ ✓. $S=\\{-2,4\\}$.","Solve $\\sqrt[4]{x^2 - 9} = 2$.":"حل $\\sqrt[4]{x^2 - 9} = 2$.","condition $x^2 \\ge 9$. $x^2 - 9 = 16$, $x = \\pm 5$ ✓. $S=\\{-5,5\\}$.":"الشرط $x^2 \\ge 9$. $x^2 - 9 = 16$، $x = \\pm 5$ ✓. $S=\\{-5,5\\}$.","Solve $\\sqrt[3]{x+6} = x$.":"حل $\\sqrt[3]{x+6} = x$.","$x^3 - x - 6 = 0$. $x=2$ is a root: $(x-2)(x^2+2x+3) = 0$, $\\Delta = 4-12<0$. $\\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$ ✓. $S=\\{2\\}$.":"$x^3 - x - 6 = 0$. $x=2$ جذر للمعادلة: $(x-2)(x^2+2x+3) = 0$، $\\Delta = 4-12<0$. $\\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$ ✓. $S=\\{2\\}$.","Solve: a) $\\sqrt[3]{x-1} < 2$; b) $\\sqrt{2x-1} \\le 3$; c) $\\sqrt[4]{x+3} > 1$.":"حل: a) $\\sqrt[3]{x-1} < 2$؛ b) $\\sqrt{2x-1} \\le 3$؛ c) $\\sqrt[4]{x+3} > 1$.","a) $x - 1 < 8$: $]-\\infty, 9[$. b) $0 \\le 2x-1 \\le 9$: $\\left[\\tfrac12, 5\\right]$. c) $x+3 > 1$: $]-2, +\\infty[$.":"a) $x - 1 < 8$: $]-\\infty, 9[$. b) $0 \\le 2x-1 \\le 9$: $\\left[\\tfrac12, 5\\right]$. c) $x+3 > 1$: $]-2, +\\infty[$.","Domain of: $f(x) = \\sqrt[3]{x^2-4}$; $g(x) = \\sqrt[4]{x^2-4}$; $h(x) = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{x-1}}$; $k(x) = \\dfrac{\\sqrt[4]{x}}{x-2}$.":"مجال تعريف: $f(x) = \\sqrt[3]{x^2-4}$؛ $g(x) = \\sqrt[4]{x^2-4}$؛ $h(x) = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{x-1}}$؛ $k(x) = \\dfrac{\\sqrt[4]{x}}{x-2}$.","$D_f = \\mathbb{R}$; $D_g = ]-\\infty,-2] \\cup [2,+\\infty[$; $D_h = \\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\{1\\}$; $D_k = [0,2[\\,\\cup\\,]2,+\\infty[$.":"$D_f = \\mathbb{R}$؛ $D_g = ]-\\infty,-2] \\cup [2,+\\infty[$؛ $D_h = \\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\{1\\}$؛ $D_k = [0,2[\\,\\cup\\,]2,+\\infty[$.","Limits: a) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to-\\infty}\\sqrt[3]{x}$; b) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{5}{\\sqrt[4]{x}}$; c) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 8}\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x}+x\\right)$; d) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0^+}\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[4]{x}}$.":"النهايات: a) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to-\\infty}\\sqrt[3]{x}$؛ b) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{5}{\\sqrt[4]{x}}$؛ c) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 8}\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x}+x\\right)$؛ d) $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0^+}\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[4]{x}}$.","a) $-\\infty$; b) $0$; c) $2 + 8 = 10$; d) $+\\infty$.":"a) $-\\infty$؛ b) $0$؛ c) $2 + 8 = 10$؛ d) $+\\infty$.","$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 7}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+1}-2}{x-7}$.":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 7}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+1}-2}{x-7}$.","$\\dfrac{0}{0}$. With $a = \\sqrt[3]{x+1}$, $b=2$: $\\dfrac{x-7}{(x-7)(a^2+2a+4)} = \\dfrac{1}{a^2+2a+4} \\to \\dfrac{1}{12}$.":"$\\dfrac{0}{0}$. مع $a = \\sqrt[3]{x+1}$ و $b=2$: $\\dfrac{x-7}{(x-7)(a^2+2a+4)} = \\dfrac{1}{a^2+2a+4} \\to \\dfrac{1}{12}$.","**Warnings specific to this level.** (1) The conjugate of a cube root is $a^2 + ab + b^2$, **not** $a+b$. (2) At $-\\infty$, $\\sqrt{x^2} = |x| = -x$ and $\\sqrt[4]{x^4} = |x|$: watch the sign. (3) Try substitution first: only use a conjugate if the form is indeterminate.":"**تحذيرات خاصة بهذا المستوى.** (1) مرافق الجذر التكعيبي هو $a^2 + ab + b^2$ و**ليس** $a+b$. (2) عند $-\\infty$، $\\sqrt{x^2} = |x| = -x$ و $\\sqrt[4]{x^4} = |x|$: انتبه للإشارة. (3) جرّب التعويض أولًا: لا تستعمل المرافق إلا إذا كانت الحالة غير معينة.","$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 1}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+3}-2}{x-1}$.":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 1}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+3}-2}{x-1}$.","$\\dfrac{(x+3)-4}{(x-1)\\left(\\sqrt{x+3}+2\\right)} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{x+3}+2} \\to \\dfrac{1}{4}$.":"$\\dfrac{(x+3)-4}{(x-1)\\left(\\sqrt{x+3}+2\\right)} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{x+3}+2} \\to \\dfrac{1}{4}$.","$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{27+3x}-3}{x}$.":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{27+3x}-3}{x}$.","with $a=\\sqrt[3]{27+3x}$, $b=3$: $\\dfrac{3x}{x(a^2+3a+9)} = \\dfrac{3}{a^2+3a+9} \\to \\dfrac{3}{27} = \\dfrac{1}{9}$.":"مع $a=\\sqrt[3]{27+3x}$ و $b=3$: $\\dfrac{3x}{x(a^2+3a+9)} = \\dfrac{3}{a^2+3a+9} \\to \\dfrac{3}{27} = \\dfrac{1}{9}$.","$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 2}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+6}-2}{x^2-4}$.":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 2}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x+6}-2}{x^2-4}$.","the numerator becomes $\\dfrac{x-2}{a^2+2a+4}$; so $\\dfrac{1}{(x+2)(a^2+2a+4)} \\to \\dfrac{1}{4\\times 12} = \\dfrac{1}{48}$.":"يصبح البسط $\\dfrac{x-2}{a^2+2a+4}$؛ إذن $\\dfrac{1}{(x+2)(a^2+2a+4)} \\to \\dfrac{1}{4\\times 12} = \\dfrac{1}{48}$.","$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+x}-x\\right)$.":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+x}-x\\right)$.","$\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+x}+x} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{x}}+1} \\to \\dfrac{1}{2}$.":"$\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+x}+x} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{x}}+1} \\to \\dfrac{1}{2}$.","$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+x}+x\\right)$.":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+x}+x\\right)$.","$\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+x}-x}$. For $x<0$: $\\sqrt{x^2+x} = -x\\sqrt{1+\\frac1x}$, so the denominator equals $-x\\left(\\sqrt{1+\\frac1x}+1\\right)$ and the quotient is $\\dfrac{-1}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac1x}+1} \\to -\\dfrac{1}{2}$.":"$\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+x}-x}$. من أجل $x<0$: $\\sqrt{x^2+x} = -x\\sqrt{1+\\frac1x}$، إذن المقام يساوي $-x\\left(\\sqrt{1+\\frac1x}+1\\right)$ والخارج هو $\\dfrac{-1}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac1x}+1} \\to -\\dfrac{1}{2}$.","$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x^3+x^2}-x\\right)$.":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x^3+x^2}-x\\right)$.","$a = \\sqrt[3]{x^3+x^2}$: $\\dfrac{x^2}{a^2+ax+x^2}$. Since $a \\sim x$, the denominator is $\\sim 3x^2$: the limit is $\\dfrac{1}{3}$.":"$a = \\sqrt[3]{x^3+x^2}$: $\\dfrac{x^2}{a^2+ax+x^2}$. بما أن $a \\sim x$، فإن المقام $\\sim 3x^2$: النهاية هي $\\dfrac{1}{3}$.","$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x+1}-\\sqrt[3]{x}\\right)$.":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x+1}-\\sqrt[3]{x}\\right)$.","$a=\\sqrt[3]{x+1}$, $b=\\sqrt[3]{x}$: $a-b = \\dfrac{1}{a^2+ab+b^2} \\to 0$.":"$a=\\sqrt[3]{x+1}$، $b=\\sqrt[3]{x}$: $a-b = \\dfrac{1}{a^2+ab+b^2} \\to 0$.","$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\frac{\\sqrt[4]{16x^4+1}}{x}$ and $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{\\sqrt[4]{16x^4+1}}{x}$.":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\frac{\\sqrt[4]{16x^4+1}}{x}$ و $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{\\sqrt[4]{16x^4+1}}{x}$.","$\\sqrt[4]{16x^4+1} = |x|\\sqrt[4]{16+\\frac{1}{x^4}}$. At $-\\infty$: $-\\sqrt[4]{16+\\frac{1}{x^4}} \\to -2$. At $+\\infty$: $\\to 2$.":"$\\sqrt[4]{16x^4+1} = |x|\\sqrt[4]{16+\\frac{1}{x^4}}$. عند $-\\infty$: $-\\sqrt[4]{16+\\frac{1}{x^4}} \\to -2$. عند $+\\infty$: $\\to 2$.","Show that $x = \\sqrt[3]{2+\\sqrt{5}} + \\sqrt[3]{2-\\sqrt{5}}$ equals $1$.":"بيّن أن العدد $x = \\sqrt[3]{2+\\sqrt{5}} + \\sqrt[3]{2-\\sqrt{5}}$ يساوي $1$.","$x^3 = 4 + 3\\sqrt[3]{(2+\\sqrt5)(2-\\sqrt5)}\\,x = 4 + 3\\sqrt[3]{-1}\\,x = 4 - 3x$. So $x^3 + 3x - 4 = (x-1)(x^2+x+4) = 0$ with $\\Delta = 1-16<0$. Hence $x = 1$.":"$x^3 = 4 + 3\\sqrt[3]{(2+\\sqrt5)(2-\\sqrt5)}\\,x = 4 + 3\\sqrt[3]{-1}\\,x = 4 - 3x$. إذن $x^3 + 3x - 4 = (x-1)(x^2+x+4) = 0$ مع $\\Delta = 1-16<0$. ومنه $x = 1$.","Simplify $\\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt2}$, $\\sqrt{7-4\\sqrt3}$, then $A = \\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt2}+\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt2}$.":"بسّط $\\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt2}$، $\\sqrt{7-4\\sqrt3}$، ثم $A = \\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt2}+\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt2}$.","$(1+\\sqrt2)^2 = 3+2\\sqrt2$ so $\\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt2} = 1+\\sqrt2$. $(2-\\sqrt3)^2 = 7-4\\sqrt3$ and $2-\\sqrt3>0$ so $\\sqrt{7-4\\sqrt3} = 2-\\sqrt3$. Likewise $\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt2} = \\sqrt2-1$, so $A = 2\\sqrt2$.":"$(1+\\sqrt2)^2 = 3+2\\sqrt2$ إذن $\\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt2} = 1+\\sqrt2$. $(2-\\sqrt3)^2 = 7-4\\sqrt3$ و $2-\\sqrt3>0$ إذن $\\sqrt{7-4\\sqrt3} = 2-\\sqrt3$. وبالمثل $\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt2} = \\sqrt2-1$، إذن $A = 2\\sqrt2$.","Show that $\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt5+2}-\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt5-2} = 1$.":"بيّن أن $\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt5+2}-\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt5-2} = 1$.","$x^3 = 4 - 3\\sqrt[3]{(\\sqrt5+2)(\\sqrt5-2)}\\,x = 4 - 3x$ since $(\\sqrt5+2)(\\sqrt5-2) = 1$. Same equation as PHOENIX-01, so $x=1$.":"$x^3 = 4 - 3\\sqrt[3]{(\\sqrt5+2)(\\sqrt5-2)}\\,x = 4 - 3x$ لأن $(\\sqrt5+2)(\\sqrt5-2) = 1$. نفس معادلة PHOENIX-01، إذن $x=1$.","Solve $\\sqrt{x+3}+\\sqrt{x-2} = 5$.":"حل $\\sqrt{x+3}+\\sqrt{x-2} = 5$.","condition $x \\ge 2$. $\\sqrt{x+3} = 5 - \\sqrt{x-2}$ gives $x+3 = 25 - 10\\sqrt{x-2} + x - 2$, i.e. $\\sqrt{x-2} = 2$, $x = 6$. Check: $3 + 2 = 5$ ✓. $S=\\{6\\}$.":"الشرط $x \\ge 2$. من $\\sqrt{x+3} = 5 - \\sqrt{x-2}$ نجد $x+3 = 25 - 10\\sqrt{x-2} + x - 2$، أي $\\sqrt{x-2} = 2$، $x = 6$. التحقق: $3 + 2 = 5$ ✓. $S=\\{6\\}$.","Solve $\\sqrt[3]{x^2} - 3\\sqrt[3]{x} + 2 = 0$.":"حل $\\sqrt[3]{x^2} - 3\\sqrt[3]{x} + 2 = 0$.","$t = \\sqrt[3]{x}$: $t^2 - 3t + 2 = 0$, $t = 1$ or $2$, so $x = 1$ or $8$. Check for $8$: $4 - 6 + 2 = 0$ ✓. $S=\\{1,8\\}$.":"نضع $t = \\sqrt[3]{x}$: $t^2 - 3t + 2 = 0$، $t = 1$ أو $2$، إذن $x = 1$ أو $8$. التحقق من $8$: $4 - 6 + 2 = 0$ ✓. $S=\\{1,8\\}$.","Solve $\\sqrt{x} - 2\\sqrt[4]{x} - 3 = 0$.":"حل $\\sqrt{x} - 2\\sqrt[4]{x} - 3 = 0$.","$t = \\sqrt[4]{x} \\ge 0$: $t^2 - 2t - 3 = 0$, $t = 3$ or $-1$; only $t=3$ works. $x = 81$ ($9 - 6 - 3 = 0$ ✓). $S=\\{81\\}$.":"نضع $t = \\sqrt[4]{x} \\ge 0$: $t^2 - 2t - 3 = 0$، $t = 3$ أو $-1$؛ فقط $t=3$ مقبول. $x = 81$ ($9 - 6 - 3 = 0$ ✓). $S=\\{81\\}$.","$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{x+\\sqrt{x}}-\\sqrt{x}\\right)$.":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{x+\\sqrt{x}}-\\sqrt{x}\\right)$.","$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{x+\\sqrt x}+\\sqrt x} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt x}}+1} \\to \\dfrac{1}{2}$.":"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{x+\\sqrt x}+\\sqrt x} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt x}}+1} \\to \\dfrac{1}{2}$.","$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{1+x}-\\sqrt{1+x}}{x}$.":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{1+x}-\\sqrt{1+x}}{x}$.","write $\\dfrac{\\sqrt[3]{1+x}-1}{x} - \\dfrac{\\sqrt{1+x}-1}{x} \\to \\dfrac13 - \\dfrac12 = -\\dfrac16$.":"نكتب $\\dfrac{\\sqrt[3]{1+x}-1}{x} - \\dfrac{\\sqrt{1+x}-1}{x} \\to \\dfrac13 - \\dfrac12 = -\\dfrac16$.","$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 1}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x}-1}{\\sqrt[4]{x}-1}$.":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 1}\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x}-1}{\\sqrt[4]{x}-1}$.","$u = \\sqrt[12]{x} \\to 1$: $\\dfrac{u^4-1}{u^3-1} = \\dfrac{(u-1)(u^3+u^2+u+1)}{(u-1)(u^2+u+1)} \\to \\dfrac{4}{3}$.":"$u = \\sqrt[12]{x} \\to 1$: $\\dfrac{u^4-1}{u^3-1} = \\dfrac{(u-1)(u^3+u^2+u+1)}{(u-1)(u^2+u+1)} \\to \\dfrac{4}{3}$."});
